<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">- NAMBYA TRANSLATION PROJECT</book>
  <para style="h">Mateo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Indebo Imbuya yakakwalwa naMateo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mateo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mat</para>
  <para style="mt2">Indebo Imbuya yakakwalwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">naMATEO</para>
  <para style="imt">Matangisilo</para>
  <para style="ip">Indebo imbuya yakakwalwa naMateo imwe yewhalo ina, imo muChivumilano Chipya inolondejela zwobupenyu bwaJesu Kristo. Imwe neimwe yajo inowhi, “Ivangeli,” zwiva kuti, “Indebo Imbuya.” Jakakwalwa naMateo, Mako, Luka, naJoni, mushule mokufa kwaJesu. Bobumhizha bwewhalo jeBhayibhili abatoziba unsi wakakwalwa iwhalo yaMateo, koga kunoyeyeselwa kuti kungaba mugole lyamakumi mana negumi limwempela Jesu azwalwa. Akale nokuti lwakakwalilwa munabupi bugalo azwitozibikana, koga banji banozumbuja kuti lwakakwalilwa muPalasitaini akale beyeyesela muguta igulwana lyeJelusalema.</para>
  <para style="ip">Unkwali ndiMateo, wakabeli untelesi Jesu esanu onshoba kuti ebe undayijwa uwe. Akale wakabezibikana nelimwe izina linowhi Levi. Mateo waluba umwe wabapositoli baligumi nababili akale wakakwalila babali bechiJuda. Yezwi zwinoboneka pachena nokulebulula zwinoswika makumi mashanu anegumi limwempela zwendebo yeChivumilano Chantolo. Wakabeda kutondejela kuti Jesu wakabeli Mesiya, uNchiji uloshalwa waMwali, wakapolofitwa nezwizwe. Mateo wakakwala bo zwinji nezwo bushe bwaMwali. BaJuda bakabaka lingilila kuti Mesiya unoba she wobushe bozwenyika. Mateo wakabhata zwibuyanana indebo yeyi enyenyejana nokudimbwa yoku ebhaunula bushe bompepo bwaMwali.</para>
  <para style="ip">Indebo imbuya yaMateo iwhalo imbuya kutangisa Chivumilano Chipya nokuda kokulebulula kwaakata nezweChivulano Chantolo. Zwinoshanganisa zwiVumilano zwibili. Imhizha jamakwalo jinopanikija kuti Mateo wakabeda kukwejejela unkwalilo wewhalo jaMozesi, jiliijo iwhalo inshanu jotanga muChivumilano Chantolo. Umbhaunulo waJesu wopedunhu (Mateo 5:1—7:29) ungakwejaniswa nopaakabepiwa mulawo Mozesi naMwali (Dutilonomi 19:3—23:33).</para>
  <para style="iot">Zwilomumwa</para>
  <para style="io1">Mateo unotangisa indebo imbuya nokulebeleka nezwokuzwalwa kwaJesu Kristo akale nokutangisa konshingo uwe muzwisiyaniso (Mateo 1:1—4:25).</para>
  <para style="io1">Zwinotobela Mateo unobanduka nezwonshingo waJesu akale nendayijo jije muzwisiyaniso (Mateo 5:1—25:46).</para>
  <para style="io1">Chikamu chopejeleja chaMateo unolebeleka nontulu wonshingo waJesu mukufa kukwe nokumuka muzwisiyaniso (Mateo 26:1—28:20).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1" />
  <para style="s">Matategulu aJesu Kristo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Luka 3:23-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1" />Iwhalo yamatategulu aJesu Kristo, mwananhulumyana waDavidi, mwananhulumyana waAbhulahamu.<verse eid="MAT 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2" />Abhulahamu wakaba elitate baIsaki, Isaki tate baJakobe, Jakobe tate baJuda nabanakwaina babe, <verse eid="MAT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3" />Juda tate baPelezi naZela bakazwalwa naTama, Pelezi tate baHeziloni, Heziloni tate baRamu, <verse eid="MAT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4" />Ramu tate baAminadabhi, Aminadabhi tate baNashoni, Nashoni elitate baSalimoni, <verse eid="MAT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5" />Salimoni tate baBhowazi, amai beli Rahabe, Bhowazi tate baObeti amai beli Lute, Obeti tate baJese, <verse eid="MAT 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6" />Jese tate ba She Davidi. Davidi wakabeli tate baSolomoni nonkaji waYuliya, <verse eid="MAT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7" />Solomoni tate baRehobhoamu, Rehobhohamu tate baAbhija, Abhija tate ba Asa,<verse eid="MAT 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8" />Asa tate baJehoshafati, Jehosafati tate baJolamu, Jolamu tate baUzia, <verse eid="MAT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9" />Uzia tate baJotamu, Jotamu tate baAhazi, Ahazi tate baHezekiya, <verse eid="MAT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10" />Hezekiya tate baManase, Manase tate baAmosi, Amosi tate baJosiya, <verse eid="MAT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11" />Josiya tate baJekoniya nabanakwaina babe, nonshaji wokutolwa kwabanhu mubuzike besengwa kuBhabhiloni. <verse eid="MAT 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12" />Mushule mwokutolwa mubuzike besengwa kuBhabhiloni, Jekoniya wakabeli tate baShelatiyeli, Shelatiyeli tate baZelubhabheli, <verse eid="MAT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13" />Zelubhabheli tate baAbhiyudi, Abhiyudi tate baEliyakimu, Eliyakimu tate baAzo, <verse eid="MAT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14" />Azo tate baZadoki, Zadoki tate baAkimu; Akimu tate baEliyudi, <verse eid="MAT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15" />Eliyudi tate baEliyeza, Eliyeza tate baMatani, Matani tate baJakobe, <verse eid="MAT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16" />Jakobe tate baJosefa, undume waMariya iye wakazwala Jesu unowhi Kristo.<verse eid="MAT 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17" />Zwose zwizekululu zwitangila pana Abhulahamu kuswikila kuna Davidi zwakabeli igumi nezwina, kuvila kunaDavidi kuswikila kutolwa kwabo mubuzike besengwa kuBhabhiloni, akale igumi nezwina, belimubuzike muBhabhiloni mane kunoswika unshaji waKristo, akale igumi nezwina.<verse eid="MAT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuzwalwa KwaJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Luka 2:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18" />Ngweno kuzwalwa kwaJesu Kristo kwakatikana neyinzila. Mai babe Mariya baluba bakatangilwa naJosefa, asi abajakabanu bashangana, Mariya wakawanikwa elinemimba yoMpepo uNchena. <verse eid="MAT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19" />Nokudalo Josefa, undume uwe, wakaba eli unhu wakalulama, ajakabeda kuumpisa ishoni kubanhu, wakayeya kuunshima musiswa. <verse eid="MAT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20" />Asi echinoyeya yezwi, ingilozi yaTezi yakaboneka kuna iye mumaloto, ikati, “Josefa, mwananhulumyana waDavidi usitye kutola Mariya kuti ebe unkaji uwo nokuti imimba yeyi ngiyoMpepo uNchena. <verse eid="MAT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21" />Unoozwala mwananhulumyana unoonshoba nezina linowhi Jesu, nokuti iye ndiye unoochija banhu babe muluchinyo lwabo.”<verse eid="MAT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22" />Zwose yezwi zwakatiwa alo kuti kuzhajikijwe zwakalebwa naTezi, mumpolofeti eti, <verse eid="MAT 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23" />“Lingani, imhandala inooba nemimba, inoochila mwananhulumyana, izina lilye unooshobwa ewhi Imanuweli” zwileba kuti, “Mwali unanasu.”<verse eid="MAT 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24" />Josefa paakamuka muhope, wakata zwaakababujwa nengilozi yaTezi, akoontola unkaji uwe, munsha uwe. <verse eid="MAT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25" />Koga aajakashangana naMariya pabulo, esanu azwala mwananhulumyana. Akale wakondundikila izina lyokuti Jesu.<verse eid="MAT 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2" />
  <para style="s">Bachenjevu Bokubuvezhuba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1" />Wakati azwalwa Jesu kuBhetelehema, munyika yeJudiya, mumazhuba aShe Helodi, bachenjevu bokubuvezhuba bakaswika kuJelusalema beva kubuvezhuba, <verse eid="MAT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2" />bakati, “Ani ukokupi she wabaJuda wazwalwa? Nokuti tabona inyenyeji yiye kubuvezhuba, ngweno isu tezha koonamata.”<verse eid="MAT 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3" />Paakawha yezwi she Helodi zwakonyaja naibo bose muJelusalema. <verse eid="MAT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4" />Wakashoba bose batebuji bakulwana nabakwali bomulawo babanhu, akababhuza kuti, “Kristo unozwalilwa kupi?”<verse eid="MAT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5" />Bakati kuna iye, “MuBhetelehema imomuJudiya, somwazwilokwalwa nompolofeti kuwhi:<verse eid="MAT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6" />“Iwi Bhetelehema, munyika yaJuda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">Autoba untukutuku kasa kubatongi baJuda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">nokuti munawi munoobhuda untongi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">uchootungamilila banhu bangu Izilayeli sondyisi.”<verse eid="MAT 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7" />Ndipo Helodi wakabashobela musiswa bachenjevu, akababhuzisisa nezwonshaji wakatanga kuboneka inyenyeji. <verse eid="MAT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8" />Wakabatuma kuBhetelehema, akati kwabali, “Indani munobhuzisisa zwomwana yoyo, kana mungongwana, muzhe mondizibisabo, kuti namibo ndinde kunoonamata.”<verse eid="MAT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9" />Pabakati bawha zwilebo zwabashe bakanyamuka bakenda, akale lingani ndipo inyenyeji ibakababona kubuvezhuba yakabatungamilila kuswikila yama pakale pakabeli nomwana. <verse eid="MAT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10" />Pabakati babona inyenyeji, bakashantilwa zwikulugulu. <verse eid="MAT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11" />Pabakangwina mungumba bakabona mwana naMariya amai babe, bakatibhama bakoonamata, bakabhisa zwipo zwabo zwendalama, indunda yefhungaijo, nobunde bwemula.<verse eid="MAT 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12" />Nokuti bakaba banyeulilwa mumaloto abo kuti besibwilile nokuna Helodi. Bakabwilila kunyika yabo neimwe inzila.<verse eid="MAT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutizhila KuIjipiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13" />Pabakati benda, iNgilozi yaTezi yakazwibonesa kuna Josefa mumaloto iti, “Nyamuka utole mwana namai babe mutizhile kuIjipiti, munogala kwakale kuswikila ndamubuja, nokuti Helodi unoopyanga mwana kuti oombulaye.”<verse eid="MAT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14" />Iye wakava anyamuka nobusiku akatola mwana na amai babe, akenda nabo kuIjipiti. <verse eid="MAT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15" />Wakagala kwakale kuswikila lufu lwaHelodi. Zutilwa kuzhajikija zwakalebwa naTezi nomumpolofeti, eti, “Ndakonshoba mwananhulumyana wangu kuti ebhude muIjipiti.”<verse eid="MAT 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubulayiwa Kwabana Banhulumyana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16" />Helodi paakabona kuti wachengwa nabachenjevu bokubuvezhuba, wakalutila kasa, akatuma balwi kuti benobulaya bana banhulumyana bose muBhetelehema nabo mudunhu yelyo lyose, bakabeli namakole mabili kana pasi, zwikwendelana nooyo unshaji waakababhuza kubachenjevu bokubuvezhuba.<verse eid="MAT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17" />Akale zwakazhajikijwa zwakalebwa nompolofeti Jelemiya, kuti,<verse eid="MAT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18" />“Iwhi lyakawhika muRama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">lilila zwikulwana kasa zwinakulwaja,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">Rasheli elilila bana babe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">wakaba esichinoda kunyalajwa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">nokuti bakaba besichipo.”<verse eid="MAT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubuya beva kuIjipiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19" />Paakati afa Helodi, Josefa wakabona ingilozi yaTezi muloto echi kuIjipiti <verse eid="MAT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20" />iti, “Nyamuka, utole mwana namai babe mubwilile kunyika yeIzilayeli, nokuti yabaya bakajoda bupenyu bwomwana bakafa.” <verse eid="MAT 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21" />Wakanyamuka, akatola mwana namai babe, bakabwilila kunyika yeIzilayeli.<verse eid="MAT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22" />Koga paakawha kuti Akelasi ndiye umutonga kuJudiya pechigalo chatate babe Helodi, wakatya kunda kwakale. Wakati abujwa naMwali muloto, ndipo paakenda kunyika yeGalili. <verse eid="MAT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23" />Wakenda akanogala muguta linowhi Nazaleta, kuli kuzhajikija yezwiya zwakalebwa nabapolofeti, kuti, “Unooshobwa ewhi uNazaleta.”<verse eid="MAT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3" />
  <para style="s">Kubhaunula kwaJoni UMbhabhatizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1" />Munaayo mazhuba Joni uMbhabhatizi wakezha ebhaunula mugwegulu lyeJudiya, <verse eid="MAT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2" />Eti, “Shandukani, nokuti bushe bwedenga bwaba pelyo!” <verse eid="MAT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3" />Nokuti Joni ndiye wakabelebwa nompolofeti Izaya paakaleba, eti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">“Iwhi linoshobelela lili mugwegulu liti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 3:3">‘Bambani ungwagwa waTezi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 3:3">lulamisani inzila yiye!’ ”<verse eid="MAT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4" />Joni walumbala zwimbalo zwobukuse bwekamela, waluba nebhanti lyeganda lyaalusunga munshana, akale zwokulya zwizwe zwaluba imhashu nobuchi bweshango. <verse eid="MAT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5" />Banhu bakezha kwaali, beva kuJelusalema, nedunhu lyose lyeJudiya nabepelyo kolwizi Jolodani. <verse eid="MAT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6" />Bakabelebulula zwibi zwabo bebhabhatizwa naiye mulwizi lweJolodani.<verse eid="MAT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7" />Wakati ebona baFalisi nabaSadusi banji bezha kwobhabhatizwa, wakati kwabali, “Imwi bana benyoka, ndiyani wakamuchenjeja kutizha bukali bukumuzha” <verse eid="MAT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8" />Tani zwito zwinotondejela kushanduka. <verse eid="MAT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9" />Akale musizwikuje muzwibuja kuti, “Tina Abhulahamu tate bedu.” Nokuti ndinomubuja kuti, Mwali unotubula kunyamula bana baAbhulahamu kuva mumabwe yaya. <verse eid="MAT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10" />Nangweno ali ishanhu lilogajikwa ponji wonti, wose unti usinozwala unchelo umbuyanana unootemwa nokulashilwa mumoto. <verse eid="MAT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11" />Ndomubhabhatiza nevula kutondejela kuti mwashanduka, asi yoyo ukumuzha mushule lyangu ndiye unesimba kupinda lyangu, anditokwelela kunyamula ishangu jije, iye ndiye uchoomubhabhatiza noMpepo uNchena akale nomoto. <verse eid="MAT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12" />Chitundu chiche chokululuja chili mumaboko. “Ndiye uchapyaila zwanana lutombo lulwe, unootutila ikoloni yiye mugombana, asi bungu unoobupisa mumoto usinojimika.”<verse eid="MAT 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubhabhatizwa kwaJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2JN 1:9-11">2 Joni 1:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21">Luka 3:21</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 3:22">22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13" />Wakezha Jesu eva kuGalili enda kuJolodani kuna Joni, kuti ebhabhatizwe naye. <verse eid="MAT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14" />Koga Joni wakajoda kulamba, eti, “Imi ndilokwelela kubhabhatizwa nawi, iwi wezha kunami chini!”<verse eid="MAT 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15" />Koga Jesu wakonshandula eti, “Ngezwibe alo ngweno. Nokuti zwilokwelela kunasu kuti tizhajikije kululama kose.” Ndipo paakavuma.<verse eid="MAT 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16" />Jesu paakati abhabhatizwa, wakabhuda muvula, pakalepo idenga lyakazhulika, akabona Mpepo waMwali ubhuluka ukata senjiba ukagala paali. <verse eid="MAT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17" />Akale iwhi lyakawhikana liva kudenga liti, “Yoyu ndiye Mwananhulumyana wangu ulodikana, ndiloshanta munaiye.”<verse eid="MAT 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4" />
  <para style="s">Kukwejwa kwaJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2JN 1:12">2 Joni 1:12</ref>,<ref loc="2JN 1:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luka 4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1" />Nezwo Jesu wakatungamilwa noMpepo kugwegulu kuti enokwejwa naGuluzhanje <verse eid="MAT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2" />Akale wakazwiminya zwokulya kwamazhuba makumi mana nobusiku makumi mana akale mushule mwezwo wakaba nenzhala. <verse eid="MAT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3" />Akale unkweji wakezha kwaali akati, “Kana uli Mwananhulumyana waMwali buja mabwe yaya ebe zwinkwa.”<verse eid="MAT 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4" />Asi wakashandula eti, Zwilokwalwa kuti, “Unhu aatolalama nechinkwa chete, koga newhi lyose linova mundomo waMwali.”<verse eid="MAT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5" />Nezwo Guluzhanje wakonsenga kuGuta iJena, akombiga pezhulu petempeli, <verse eid="MAT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6" />akale akati kwaali, “Kana uli Mwananhulumyana waMwali, zwiposele pasi”, nokuti zwilokwalwa kuti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">“Unoolaya ingilozi nezwizwo akale</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:6">namaboko ajo jinookunyamulila pezhulu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:6">kuti usigubhulwe nebwe.”<verse eid="MAT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7" />Jesu wakati kwaali, “Akale zwilokwalwa kuti, autokwelela kukweja Tezi Mwali uwo.”<verse eid="MAT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8" />Akale, Guluzhanje wakonsenga pezhulu pedunhu ilefu kasakasa, akontondeja bushe bwopasi penyika yose nolukujo lwabo lwose, <verse eid="MAT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9" />akale wakati kwaali, “Zwose yezwi ndokupa, kana chete ungondifhugamila undinamate.”<verse eid="MAT 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10" />Nezwo Jesu wakati kwaali, “Ibhuda yopa, Satani!” Nokuti zwilokwalwa kuti, “Namata Tezi uwo, akale unokwelela kushingila iye chete!”<verse eid="MAT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11" />Nezwo guluzhanje wakava oonsiya, akale ilingani, ingilozi jakezha jikombhancha.<verse eid="MAT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu unotanga unshingo uwe muGalili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:14">Mako 1:14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 1:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14">Luka 4:14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 4:15">15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12" />Ngweno paakawha kuti Joni wasungwa, wakanyamuka akenda kuGalili, <verse eid="MAT 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13" />akale wakabhuda muNazaleta, akenda kunogala kuKapenaume, pelyo negungwa munyika yeZebhuloni neNafitali, <verse eid="MAT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14" />kuti yezwiya zwakabalebwa noMpolofeti Izaya zwizhajikijwe,<verse eid="MAT 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15" />“Inyika yaZebhuloni nenyika yaNafitali,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">zwinda kugungwa museli mweJolodani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">iGalili, nyika yaBokuzhe!<verse eid="MAT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16" />Banhu bakabeligele munhilima</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">babona mwenje unkulwana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">akale kunaabo bakabeligele munyika nomuntuzi wolufu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">mwenje wezha.”<verse eid="MAT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17" />Kuvila nonshaji yoyo, Jesu wakatanga kupupula eti, “Shandukani, nokuti bushe bwedenga bwabapelyo!”<verse eid="MAT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu unoshoba bavubi bana.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mako 1:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luka 5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18" />Eli mukukwenda mumbali mwegungwa lyeGalili, wakabona unkulu nonuna belibabili, Simoni unowhi Pita, naEndulu ununa uwe, beteya ivubo mugungwa, nokuti baluba bavubi behobe. <verse eid="MAT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19" />Wakati kwabali, “Nditobeleni, ndomuta bavubi babanhu.” <verse eid="MAT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20" />Pakalepo bakasiya mavubo abo bakontobela.<verse eid="MAT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21" />Akale paakendila mbeli wakabona bamwe babili, unkulu nonuna, Jemusi mwananhulumyana waZebhedi, nonuna uwe Joni, mubwato natate babo Zebhedi, befhumulula ivubo jabo akale wakabashoba. <verse eid="MAT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22" />Pakalepo bakasiya bwato natate babo, bakontobela.<verse eid="MAT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu unolayija, bhaunula nokuchija.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Luka 6:17-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23" />Akale wakakwendenda iGalili lyose, elayija mubugalo bokunamatila bwabaJuda bunowhi ma abo, akale epupula iNdebo iMbuya yobushe akale echilisa malwaji wose akale nobukosha bose mukati mwabanhu. <verse eid="MAT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24" />Sezwo impuwo yiye yakamwalalika muSiliya yose, akale bakabuza kwaali balwaji bose, naabo balunyajwa namalwaji alosiyanasiyana akale nokulwajilwa, baluba namadimoni, bezwisuntu, akale nabana bukosha, wakabachilisa. <verse eid="MAT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25" />Akale mabuta makulwana akontobela eva kuGalili, kumakuta igumi anowhi Dikapolisi, muJelusalema, muJudiya akale nomuseli mweJolodani.<verse eid="MAT 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5" />
  <para style="s">Umbhaunulo wopedunhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1" />Jesu ebona ibunga, wakatanha idunhu, paakati agala pasi, balayijwa babe bakezha kwaali. <verse eid="MAT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2" />Akale wakalebeleka ebalayija eti,<verse eid="MAT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lushanto Lwechokomende</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:20-23">Luka 6:20-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3" />“Balokombolelwa basheti mumpepo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:3">nokuti bushe bwedenga ngobwabo”<verse eid="MAT 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4" />Balokombolelwa yabo banolila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:4">nokuti banoonyalajwa.<verse eid="MAT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5" />“Balokombolelwa yabo banyolo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:5">nokuti banootambula inyika”<verse eid="MAT 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6" />Balokombolelwa yabo banenzhala nenyota yobululami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:6">nezwo banogunchwa.<verse eid="MAT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7" />Balokombolelwa yabo baneshe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:7">nokuti banoowhilwa ishe.<verse eid="MAT 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8" />Balokombolelwa bana mwoyo unchena,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:8">nokuti banoobona Mwali!<verse eid="MAT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9" />“Balokombolelwa yabo banobuza lunyalalo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:9">nokuti banoowhi bana baMwali”<verse eid="MAT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10" />“Balokombolelwa banoshungulujwa pezhulu pobululami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:10">nokuti bushe bwedenga ngobwabo”<verse eid="MAT 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11" />“Mulokombolelwa imwi, kana mutukwa, mushungulujwa, nokulebelwa zwose zwibi zwokuniepa pezhulu pangu” <verse eid="MAT 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12" />Shantani akale munakilwe, nokuti indipilo yenu ihulwana kudenga, nokuti bapolofeti bakabelipo mbeli kwenu bakashungulujwa bo.<verse eid="MAT 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mumunyu noMwenje</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mako 9:50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34">Luka 14:34</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 14:35">35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13" />“Imwi mumunyu wenyika, asi kana munyu washampuka, ungatubula kubwiliza kulwela na? Auchina nshingo, kuzhe kokuti ulashwe pazhe pauchatobwa nabanhu”<verse eid="MAT 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14" />“Imwi mumwenje wenyika. Iguta lilobakilwa pedunhu alitosisika” <verse eid="MAT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15" />Akale banhu abatotutumisa chimuniko kova bechitibhikila nehali, asi banochibiga pechitala, kutila kuti chimunikile bose mumba. <verse eid="MAT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16" />“Mwenje wenu ngaupenye mbeli kwabanhu, kuti bebone mishingo yenu mibuyanana akale bepe lukujo kunaTate benu baiko kudenga”<verse eid="MAT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulayija nezwoMulawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17" />Musiyeye kuti ndezha kobhisa mulawo waMozesi, newhalo jabapolofeti. Andijezha koozwibhisa koga koozwizhajikija. <verse eid="MAT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18" />Chokomende ndinoti kwamuli, kuswikila idenga nenyika zwapela, apana kana limwempela ibala lyomulawo linoobhiswa kuswikila zwose zwazhajikijwa. <verse eid="MAT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19" />Aani naani usinotobeleja umwe wemilawo yeyi kojoba ulintukutuku, elayija banhu kuti bete alo, unooba untukutuku mubushe bwedenga, asi iye unolondota akale elayija banhu kuti bete alo, ndiye uchoowhi unkulwana mubushe bwedenga. <verse eid="MAT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20" />Nokudalo ndinomubuja kuti, kuzhe kokuti bululami bwenu bupinde bululami bwabakwali nobwabaFalisi, chokomende amutoomungwina mubushe bwedenga.<verse eid="MAT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulayijwa pezhulu pokunyema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21" />“Mwakawha zwakababujwa banhu bantolo kuti, ‘Usibulaye, wose unobulaya unhu unoopiwa untongo uwe.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22" />Koga imi ndoti kunamwi, wose unonyemela mwanakwaina unoopiwa untongo, akale yoyo unotuka mwanakwaina unoosengwa pegota, akale yoyo unoti, ‘Iwi lema!’ unokwelela kuposelwa mumoto wegehena. <verse eid="MAT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23" />Kana usenga umpilo uwo kudebulilo, kova ukumbuluka kuti mwanakwaina uwo ulokunyemela, <verse eid="MAT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24" />siya chipo chicho mbeli kwedebulilo, unde unowhanana nomwanakwaina uwo, ndipo pauchoobuya, upila chipo chicho.<verse eid="MAT 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25" />“Ita bukwaina nontamijili uwo, nokukambija muchimunzila mukwenda mose munda kugota, nokuti untamijili uwo unokupila kuntongi, akale untongi kundindi, akale iwi unobigwa muntolongo. <verse eid="MAT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26" />Chokomende ndoti kunawi, autoobhuda mukati, kuswikila walipa imali yose kunoswika pekobeli lyopejisila.<verse eid="MAT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Indayijo Pezhulu Pokupombola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27" />“Mwakawha zwakalebwa kuti, ‘Musipombole.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28" />Koga ndinoti kwamuli, wose unolinga unhukaji oondakamila, wapombola naye kale mumwoyo uwe. <verse eid="MAT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29" />Kana izhisho lilyo lyokululyi likuchinyisa, libhise ulilashe nokuti zwibuyanana kwauli kuti ulashikilwe nechimwe chibabi chombili uwo, kuna kuti umbili uwo wose ulashilwe mugehena. <verse eid="MAT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30" />Kana luboko lulwo lwokululyi lukuchinyisa, ludumule ululashe, nokuti zwibuyanana kwauli kuti kulashike chimwe chibabi chombili uwo, pana kuti umbili uwo wose unde mugehena.<verse eid="MAT 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Indayijo Pezhulu Pokushimana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:9">Mateo 19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11">Mako 10:11</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 10:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luka 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31" />“Zwakalebwa kabili kuti, ‘Aani nani unoshima unkaji uwe, ngeumpe lukwalo lokushima.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32" />Koga ndinoti kwamuli, wose unoshima unkaji uwe, kuzhe kokuti wapombola, unounta imhombwe, akale upi azwe unolobola unhukaji washimwa neebo unoba apombola.<verse eid="MAT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Indayijo Pezhulu Pokukowha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33" />“Mwakawha kabili kuwhi kubanhu bantolo, ‘Musikowhe maniepwa, asi zhajikijani ikowhe lyenu kunaTezi.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34" />Koga ndinoti kunamwi, musikowhe nalini, kana nedenga, nokuti ndicho chigalo chobushe bwaMwali, <verse eid="MAT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35" />kana nenyika, nokuti chibhula chiche chokutobelela makumbo awe, kana neJelusalema, nokuti iguta igulwana lyaShe unkulugulu. <verse eid="MAT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36" />Usikowhe nonsholo uwo, nokuti auna isimba lyokushandula ivuji kuti libe jena kana kuba idema. <verse eid="MAT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37" />Zwaunoleba ngezwibe ‘Eya’ kana ‘Ne’ zwimwe zwinopinda yezwi zwinobeva kumbengi.<verse eid="MAT 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Indayijo pezhulu pokubwilizila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:29">Luka 6:29</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:30">30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38" />“Mwakawha kuti kwakawhi, ‘Izhisho nezhisho akale izhino nezhino.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39" />Koga ndinoti kunamwi, musimisikijane noyo umbi. Asi kana umwe angokuloba pedama lyokululyi, shanduka umpe limwe bo. <verse eid="MAT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40" />Kana umwe angokusungisa kova ekutolela chibaki chicho, undekeje etole neshashiko iyo neebo. <verse eid="MAT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41" />Kana unhu akumanikija kuti unde naye unshizho umwempela, inda naye mishizho mibili. <verse eid="MAT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42" />Umpe iye unokukumbila, usiuminye neebo yoyo unocheneka.<verse eid="MAT 5:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ida babengi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:27">Luka 6:27</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:28">28</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:32-36">32-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43" />“Mwakawha kuti kwakawhi, ‘ida umbakijani uwo, koga ubenge umbengi uwo.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44" />Koga ndinoti kwamuli, idani babengi benu, banamatileni yabo banomuyangatisa, <verse eid="MAT 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45" />kuti mube bana baTate benu baiko kudenga, nokuti unota izhuba lilye lije kubabi nokubabuya, akale unopa ivula kubalulami nabasilolulama. <verse eid="MAT 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46" />Kana muda banomuda, mowana indiponi! Ibo batelesi abatota alo na? <verse eid="MAT 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47" />Akale kana mumusa banakwaina benu chete, ini zwamukumuta kupinda bamwe? Nabokuzhe abatota zwakalezo na? <verse eid="MAT 5:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48" />Nokudalo imwi ibani banhu balopelelela, saTate benu bokudenga balopelelela.<verse eid="MAT 5:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6" />
  <para style="s">Kulayija nezwemishingo mibuya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1" />“Chenjelani kuta mishingo yenu mbeli kwabanhu kuti mubonwe naibo, amutowana indipilo inova kuna Tate benu baiko kudenga.<verse eid="MAT 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2" />“Nezwo, kana mupa zwipo kubasheti, musilije lukwembo, sezwinotiwa nabachengeji mumasinagogo nomumigwagwa, betila kuti bekujwe nabanhu. Chokomende, ndinoti kwamuli, indipilo yabo bakaitambula kale. <verse eid="MAT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3" />Asi iwi, paunopa chipo chokubhancha, luboko lulwo lwechesho lusizibe kuti luboko lulo lwolulyi lukumutani, <verse eid="MAT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4" />kutila kuti kubhancha kukwo kube musiswa, akale Tate babo banobona zwimomusiswa banookupa indipilo yiyo.”<verse eid="MAT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulayija nezwomunamato.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Luka 11:2-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5" />Akale pamunonamata, amutokwelela kuba sabachengeji, banoda kuma benamata mumasinagogo nopalujibo lwemigwagwa, kuti bebonwe nabanhu. Chokomende ndinoti kwamuli, batambula kale indipilo yabo. <verse eid="MAT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6" />Koga paunonamata, ngwina mungumba yiyo, uzwikonyele, unamate kuna Tate babo musiswa, akale Tate babo, banobona zwomusiswa, ndibo banokupa indipilo yiyo.<verse eid="MAT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7" />Akale mukunamata musilundike mawhi manji sezwinota bokuzhe, nokuti banoyeya kuti banowhikwa pezhulu pamawhi abo manji. <verse eid="MAT 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8" />Musibe saibo, nokuti Tate benu banoziba zwamunoshaka musanu mwabakumbila. <verse eid="MAT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9" />Nokudalo namatani ali,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">Tate bedu bokudenga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:9">izina lyenu ngalikujwe,<verse eid="MAT 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10" />bushe bwenu ngabuswike,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:10">chido chenu ngechitiwe penyika sokudenga.<verse eid="MAT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11" />Tipeni nasi chinkwa chedu chemisi nemisi,<verse eid="MAT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12" />akale tilekejeleni luchinyo lwedu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:12">sezwo tilekejela banotichinyila bo.<verse eid="MAT 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13" />Musitilekelele tiwila mukukwejwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:13">koga mutisungunule kububi.<verse eid="MAT 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14" />Kana mulekejela banhu banomuchinyila, Tate benu bokudenga banomulekejela neebo. <verse eid="MAT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15" />Asi kana musinolekejela banhu banomuchinyila, naTate benu bokudenga, abatomulekejela luchinyo lwenu.<verse eid="MAT 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulayija pezhulu pokulya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16" />“Akale pamunozwiminya kulya, musishetuluke sabachengeji, nokuti banonyangabala kumesho kwabo betila kubonwa nabanhu kuti bakumuzwiminya kulya. Chokomende ndinoti kwamuli, batambula indipilo yabo kale. <verse eid="MAT 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17" />Asi kana uzwiminya kulya, shamba kumesho ugube mafuta munsholo, <verse eid="MAT 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18" />kuti kuzwiminya kuko kulya kusibonwe nabanhu, koga naTate babo bomusiswa, akale Tate babo banobona musiswa, ndibo bachakupa indipo yiyo.”<verse eid="MAT 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ifuma yokudenga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:33">Luka 12:33</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 12:34">34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19" />“Musizwibunganisile bufumi penyika, pana makube nengula zwinolya akale nembava jinobulaya ingumba jikwiba. <verse eid="MAT 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20" />Asi zwibunganisileni chuma kudenga, kusina makube nengula zwinolya, akale kusina imbava jinobulaya jingumba nokukwiba. <verse eid="MAT 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21" />Nokuti yopo pana ifuma yiyo, ndipo pachabelina moyo uwo.”<verse eid="MAT 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwenje woMbili.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:34-36">Luka 11:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22" />“Izhisho chimuniko chombili. Kana izhisho lilyo lilibhenyu, umbili uwo wose unomunikilwa. <verse eid="MAT 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23" />Asi kana izhisho lilyo lililibi, umbili uwo wose unoba munhilima. Kana mwenje umomwauli uli nhilima, biya inhilima yeyo inobeli ihulwana zwilichini!”<verse eid="MAT 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwali nechuma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 16:13">Luka 16:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">12:22-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24" />“Akuna unhu angashingila matezi mabili, nokuti angabenga umwe akale akada umwe, kana kuti angazwipila kunaumwe eshunda umwe. Amungashingile Mwali nemali.”<verse eid="MAT 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25" />Nokudalo ndomubuja kuti, lekani kuzwinyaja nezwobupenyu bwenu, zwokuti molyani, kana kuti monwani, kana nezwombili wenu zwokuti mombalani. Bupenyu abutobabukulwana kupinda zwokulya kana umbili kupinda zwokumbala na? <verse eid="MAT 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26" />Lingani inyuni jedenga, ajitobyala akale ajitovuna, kana kubunganya mumakombana, koga Tate benu bokudenga banojichelela. Imwi amutodikana kujipinda na? <verse eid="MAT 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27" />Akale ndiyani pakati penu angapamija unshaji wobupenyu bubwe nokuzwinyaja?<verse eid="MAT 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28" />“Ani ini muzwinyanja nezwombala? Lingani maluba eshango kuti anokubuka chini, aatoshinga nesimba kana kuluka.” <verse eid="MAT 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29" />Asi ndomubuja kuti, kojoba iye Solomoni mukushongeka kukwe aajakambala selimwe lyawo. <verse eid="MAT 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30" />Koga kana Mwali embajika ali buhwa bwomuminda, ibo bunoti nasi bupenyu, mangwana bwaposelwa mumoto. Aatomumbajika zwibuyanana na? Imwi bana kudimbwa kutukutuku!<verse eid="MAT 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31" />“Nokudalo musizwinyaje muti, tolyani akale tonwani kana kuti, tombalani?” <verse eid="MAT 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32" />Nokuti bokuzhe banozwishaka zwose yezwi zwinhu, akale Tate benu bokudenga banozwiziba kuti mozwidabo zwose yezwi. <verse eid="MAT 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33" />“Asi shakani bushe bwaMwali kutanga akale nobululami bubwe, zwose zwinhu yezwi zwinoba zwenu akale. <verse eid="MAT 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34" />Nokudalo musizwinyaje nezwamangwana, nokuti lyamangwana linozwinyajila zwalyo. Lekeja injabulo jeelyo izhuba jizhulile yeelyo izhuba.”<verse eid="MAT 6:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7" />
  <para style="s">Musitonge bamwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:37">Luka 6:37</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:38">38</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:41">41</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:42">42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1" />“Musipe untongo, kutila kuti musitongwe neebo.” <verse eid="MAT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2" />Nokuti nenzila yamunotonga nayo bamwe, munootongwa bo, akale munookwelwa nonkwelo wamunokwela nawo. <verse eid="MAT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3" />Ini ubona kababi muzhisho lyomwanakwaina uwo usinobona idanda muzhisho lilyo? <verse eid="MAT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4" />Kana kuti ungati kumwanakwaina uwo, ‘Ima, ndikubhise kakunyana muzhisho lilyo,’ imo muzhisho lilyo mulinedanda? <verse eid="MAT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5" />Iwi nchengeji! Tanga wabhisa idanda limwo muzhisho lilyo, kutila kuti utubule kubona zwanana kubhisa kakunyana kamo muzhisho lyomwanakwaina uwo. <verse eid="MAT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6" />Musipe imbwa zwinhu zwichena, musiposele bulungu bulokosha mbeli kwengulube, nokuti ingulube jinozwitoba namakumbo ajo, kova imbwa jimuluma.<verse eid="MAT 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumbila, Shaka, Gogoja</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Luka 11:9-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7" />“Kumbilani, munopiwa, shakani, munowana, gogojani, munozhulilwa.” <verse eid="MAT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8" />Nokuti wose unokumbila, unopiwa, noyo unoshaka unowana, nouno gogoja, unozhulilwa. <verse eid="MAT 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9" />Ndiani pakati penu unoti, kana mwananhulumyana uwe akumbila chinkwa, eumpe ibwe? <verse eid="MAT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10" />Kana kuti akumbila ihobe eumpe inyoka? <verse eid="MAT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11" />Kana imwi babi mutubula kupa bana benu zwipo zwibuyanana, biya Tate baiko kudenga abangape zwipo zwibuyanana kunaabo banokumbila kwaali na? <verse eid="MAT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12" />Nokudalo zwose zwamunoda kuti banhu bemutile, zwiteni neebo kunaibo, nokuti yoyu ndiwo mulawo newhalo jabaPolofeti.<verse eid="MAT 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ishubo idukutuku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:24">Luka 13:24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13" />“Ngwinani neshubo lilomanikila. Nokuti lilokwazabuka ishubo, nenzila yadeni ilelu, inosenga kukupalajwa akale banji banongwina neeyo inzila. <verse eid="MAT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14" />Asi ishubo idukutuku, nenzila ilomanikila inoswincha kubupenyu, akale bashoma banoyiwana.<verse eid="MAT 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unti nemichelo yawo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43">Luka 6:43</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:44">44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15" />“Chenjelelani bapolofeti bamaniepwa, banozha kunamwi bekambala ibhapata lyemhwizi, asi mukati beli mapele anabukali. <verse eid="MAT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16" />Munoobaziba nemichelo yabo. Unchelo wonzhambi unowanika mumiwha na, kana kuti ihuyu munti womhiwa? <verse eid="MAT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17" />Nokudalo wose unti umbuyanana unozwala michelo mibhodo, asi unti umbi unozwala michelo mibi. <verse eid="MAT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18" />Unti umbuya aungazwale michelo mibi, neebo unti umbi aungazwale michelo mibuya. <verse eid="MAT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19" />Wose unti usinozwala unchelo umbuya unotemwa kova uposelwa mumoto. <verse eid="MAT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20" />Nokudalo munoobaziba nemichelo yabo.<verse eid="MAT 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Andijakamuziba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">Luka 13:25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21" />“Abatoba bose banoti kunami, ‘Tezi, Tezi’ bachoongwina mubushe bwokudenga, koga yoyo unota kuda kwaTate bangu baiko kudenga. <verse eid="MAT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22" />Nelyo izhuba banji banooti kwandili, ‘Tezi, Tezi! atijakapolofita muzina lyenu, akale tikabhisa madimoni nezina lyenu, akale tikata mishingo mikulwana nezina lyenu na?’ <verse eid="MAT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23" />Imi ndinoobabuja pachena nditi, anditomuziba, bhudani yopa, imwi bachinyi!’<verse eid="MAT 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umbaki Ilema Nombaki Ulochenjela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:47-49">Luka 6:47-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24" />“Wose unowha mawhi angu akale ewata, unooba sonhu ulochenjela wakabaka ingumba yiye pamwala.” <verse eid="MAT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25" />Ivula yakana, lwizi lukazhala akezha, ibhepo likezha zwikaloba ingumba, asi aijakawa, nokuti yaluba ikabakilwa pamwala.<verse eid="MAT 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26" />Akale wose unowha mawhi angu akale esinowatobeleja, unanga sonhu ilema wakabaka ingumba yiye pezhulu ponsechelele. <verse eid="MAT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27" />Ivula yakana, lwizi lukazhala akezha, ibhepo likezha, zwikaloba ingumba yeyo ikawa, akale kuwa kwayo kwakaba kukulwana!”<verse eid="MAT 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isimba lyaJesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28" />Wakati Jesu apeja kulebeleka mawhi yaya, ibunga lyabanhu lyakashamiswa nendayijo yiye, <verse eid="MAT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29" />nokuti wakalayija sonhu unanesimba, aajakata sabakwali babo bomulawo.<verse eid="MAT 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8" />
  <para style="s">Jesu unochija unhu unabulwaji bwamapelembuji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mako 1:40-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luka 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1" />Paakabhuluka mudunhu ibunga igulwana lyakontobela, <verse eid="MAT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2" />Pakalepo undwaji wamapelembuji wakezha kwaali, akafhigama mbeli kukwe, akati, “Tezi, kana muda mungandichenesa.”<verse eid="MAT 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3" />Akale wakatambunuja luboko lulwe akoonguma eti, “Ndoda, chena.” Akale nokukambija bulwaji bwamapelembuji bwakashambijika. <verse eid="MAT 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4" />Akale Jesu wakati kwaali, “Usibuje banhu banji asi inda kuntebuji, upile chipo chawakalayilwa naMozesi kuti chibe chitondejo kubanhu.”<verse eid="MAT 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Unochilisa Unshingi Wontungamili Wabezana WeRoma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Luka 7:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5" />Engwina muKapenaume, kwakezha kwaali untungamili wabalwi izana, akombweta <verse eid="MAT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6" />akale eti, “Tezi, unshingi wangu ulele nobukosha kungumba mukunyajikana kukulwana kasa.”<verse eid="MAT 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7" />Wakati kuna iye, “Ndichezha koonchilisa.”<verse eid="MAT 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8" />Asi untungamili wabezana wakashandula eti, “She andilokwelela kuti mungwine mungumba yangu, koga ilebani iwhi chete unshingi wangu unochila. <verse eid="MAT 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9" />Nezwo ndinhu upo pasi pobutongi, ndina balwi behondo bapo pasi pangu, akale kunomwe wabo ndinoti, ‘Inda!’ kova enda, kunomwe ndoti, ‘izha!’ unozha, akale kundanda wangu ndinoti, ‘ita yezwi!’ kova ezwita.”<verse eid="MAT 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10" />Jesu paakonwha, wakachenama akati kuna yabo bakabontobela, “Chokomende muIzilayeli andijanu ndawana kudimbwa kwakadai. <verse eid="MAT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11" />Ndinomubuja banji banoova kubuvezhuba nokubumililo banoogala petebuli naAbhulahamu, Isaki naJakobe mubushe bokudenga, <verse eid="MAT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12" />banhu bobushe banoolashwa munhilima yokuzhe, yoko banhu banoolila akale meno anogedageda.” <verse eid="MAT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13" />Akale Jesu wakati kuNtungamili wabezana, “Inda, utilwe sokudimbwa kuko.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 8:13">Akale unshingi wakachijwa nonshaji wakaleyo.<verse eid="MAT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Unochilisa Banhu Banji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mako 1:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luka 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14" />Akale Jesu paakangwina mungumba yaPita, wakabona amezwale baPita belilele, belwala bepisa mbili. <verse eid="MAT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15" />Wakababhata luboko, kupisa mbili kukapela, bakanyamuka bakonshingila nokuumpakulila. <verse eid="MAT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16" />Nobusiku yobo bakabuza kwaali banhu banji bakaba beli namadimoni, kova etatamila mipepo mibi, eshingisa iwhi chete, akale kova echilisa bose bakabelwala. <verse eid="MAT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17" />Yoku kwaluba kuzhajikija zwakalebwa nompolofeti Izaya kuti, “wakanyamula manyajo edu akatwiga malwaji edu.”<verse eid="MAT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuba Untobeli WaJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:57-62">Luka 9:57-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18" />Feno Jesu paakabona ibunga likonkombolojela, wakabuja balayijwa babe kuti ukumuda kunda kunelimwe ibhazu. <verse eid="MAT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19" />Umwe wabakwali wakezha kwaali akati, “Ndayiji, ndokutobela kwose kwaunonda.”<verse eid="MAT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20" />Jesu wakati kuna iye, “Ihaba jina mapako, akale nenyuni jedenga jina zwizhumbo, asi Mwananhulumyana woNhu aana pokubiga unsholo uwe.”<verse eid="MAT 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21" />Umwe wabalayijwa wakati kwaali, “Tezi ndileke nditange ndanojika tate bangu.”<verse eid="MAT 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22" />Asi Jesu wakati kwaali, “Nditobele, akale lekeja bakafa bejike bafi babo.”<verse eid="MAT 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu unonyalaja ibhepo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mako 4:35-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luka 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23" />Akale paakangwina mubwato, balayijwa babe bakontobela. <verse eid="MAT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24" />Hezwo, kwakanyamuka ibhepo igulwana mugungwa, nezwo bwato bwakabekupilwa namakampo, asi wakaba elilele. <verse eid="MAT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25" />Akale balayijwa bakenda bakoumusa beti, “She tichijeni, talobonwila ndondwe!”<verse eid="MAT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26" />Akale wakati kwabali, “Ini mutya, imwi banhu bokudimbwa kushoma?” Kova enyamuka, ekalalila ibhepo negungwa, kukaba nokunyalala kukulwana. <verse eid="MAT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27" />Akale banhu bakashamiswa nezwi bakati, “unhu wakata chini yoyu, unowhililwa nebhepo negungwa”<verse eid="MAT 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Unochilisa banhulume babili banamadimoni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mako 5:1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luka 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28" />Akale Jesu paakaswika kunelimwe ibhazu, kunyika yabaGadalena, wakashangana nabanhu babili banamadimoni, beva kumakumbu, bakabetyisa zwokuti apana wakabepinda nooko. <verse eid="MAT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29" />Pakalepo bakashomeja beti, “unaneni zokuta nasu iwi Mwananhulumyana waMwali? wezha kotishunguluja unshaji usanu waswika na”<verse eid="MAT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30" />Feno idanga inji lyengulube lyakabechela, peli nakashizho kuva yopo pabakabeli. <verse eid="MAT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31" />Akale madimoni akombweta eti, “Kana mungotibhisa, mutisenge mudanga lyengulube.”<verse eid="MAT 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32" />Akale wakati kwaali, “Indani.” akabhuda, akanongwina mungulube, akale idanga lyose lyakalabukila pebhilipili mane mugungwa, likanofila muvula.<verse eid="MAT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33" />Bacheji bakatizha benda kuguta, bakapupula zwose zwakabatikana akale nezwakatikana kubanhu banamadimoni. <verse eid="MAT 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34" />Akale ilingani, iguta lyose lyakabhuda linda kunoshangana naJesu, pabakoombona bakonkumbila kuti ebhude munyika yabo.<verse eid="MAT 8:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9" />
  <para style="s">Jesu unochilisa igosha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mako 2:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luka 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1" />Akale Jesu wakangwina mubwato akatalukila museli akaswika muguta lyokunaibo. <verse eid="MAT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2" />Akale pakalepo, bakabuza igosha kwaali, lililele pabushasha bwalyo, akale Jesu abona kudimbwa kwabo, wakati kugosha, “Shanta mwananhulumyana wangu, luchinyo lulo lwalekejelwa.”<verse eid="MAT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3" />Akale ilingani, bamwe babakwali bakalebeleka mumyoyo yabo beti, “Yoyu unhu ukumutuka Mwali.”<verse eid="MAT 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4" />Koga Jesu eziba indangalilo jabo, wakati, “Ini muyeya yezwi mumyoyo yenu” <verse eid="MAT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5" />Ini zwilelu, kuti, “Luchinyo lulo lwalekejelwa kana kuti, ‘Milika ukwende?’ <verse eid="MAT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6" />Koga kutila kuti muzibe kuti Mwananhulumyana woNhu unesimba penyika yopano lyokulekejela luchinyo,” kova eti kugosha, “nyamuka utole bushasha bubo, unde kungumba kuko.”<verse eid="MAT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7" />Wakanyamuka akenda kusha kukwe. <verse eid="MAT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8" />Mabunga paakazwibona yezwi, akatya, akale akakuja Mwali, iye wakapa masimba akadai kubanhu.<verse eid="MAT 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu unoshoba Mateo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mako 2:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luka 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9" />Jesu epinda eva kwakabeli, wakabona unhulume waluwhi Mateo eligele mungumba yokutelela, wakati kwaali, “Nditobele.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:9">Wakanyamuka akoontobela. <verse eid="MAT 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10" />Akale wakati eli mungumba belikumulya, kwakezha batelesi nabachinyi banji, bakagala pasi naJesu nabalayijwa babe. <verse eid="MAT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11" />BaFalisi bazwibona yezwi bakati kubalayijwa babe, “Undayiji wenu ini, elya nabatelesi nabachinyi”<verse eid="MAT 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12" />Paakazwiwha yezwi, wakati kwabali, “Bana buchilo bubuya abatopyanga undapi, koga yabo banolwala. <verse eid="MAT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13" />Indani, munolayijwa kuti yezwi zwinolebani kuti ‘Ndinoda ishe, kusi umpilo.’ Nokuti andijakezha koshoba bakalulama, koga bachinyi.”<verse eid="MAT 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umbhuzo pezhulu pokuzwiminya kulya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mako 2:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luka 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14" />Kova balayijwa baJoni umbhabhatizi bezha kwaali, beti, “Ini isu nabaFalisi tizwiminya kulya tunjinji, koga balayijwa babo abatozwiminya kulya”<verse eid="MAT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15" />Jesu wakati kwabali, “Bakokwa pamuchado bangalila na, kana unkwasha ukumuchada echimukati mwabo?” Mazhuba anooswika paachobhiswa umulobolwa pakati pabo, ndipo pabachazwiminya kulya.<verse eid="MAT 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16" />Akale akuna angabiga chigamba chipya pechimbalo chilokulumpala nokuti chigamba chino jeluka pechimbalo, akale kujeluka kunoba kukulwana. <verse eid="MAT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17" />Nokudalo iwaini impya aitodilwa mumikabo yantolo, zwingodalo mikabo inokwamuka, iwaini kova ikutuka, neebo mikabo inofa, koga iwaini impya inodilwa mumikabo mipya, zwingodalo yezwi zwibili zwinolondoteka.<verse eid="MAT 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwananhukajana Wontongi Wonhukaji Wakabhata Ishashiko YaJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mako 5:21-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luka 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18" />Echinolebeleka kwabali, kwakaswika untongi akafhigama mbeli kukwe, akati, “Mwananhukajana wangu washaika ngweno ali, koga ande, ungobiga luboko lulo panaiye, unolalama.”<verse eid="MAT 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19" />Jesu wakanyamuka akontobela nabalayijwa babe.<verse eid="MAT 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20" />Akale ilingani, umwe unhukaji wakabajiijwa nokubhuda ilopa kwamakole igumi namabili, wakasendela mushule mumwe, akabhata lupeto lwechimbalo chiche, <verse eid="MAT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21" />wakati mumwoyo uwe, “Ndingobhata chimbalo chiche chete, ndochila.”<verse eid="MAT 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22" />Jesu wakachingunuka, paakombona, wakati: “Shanta, mwananhukajana, kudimbwa kuko kwakuchilisa.” Pakalepo unhukaji yoyo wakachila.<verse eid="MAT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23" />Jesu paakaswika kungumba yontongi, akale akabona baliji bemitetele bopedilwe nabanhu banjinji pelina iditi, <verse eid="MAT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24" />wakati, “bhudani, nokuti unsichana yoyu aajafa, koga ulele.” Ibo bakonseka. <verse eid="MAT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25" />Ibunga lyabhisilwa pazhe, Iye wakangwina mumba akabhata luboko lwonsichana, unsichana akamuka. <verse eid="MAT 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26" />Akale chisumo yechi chakawhikwa munyika yeyo yose.<verse eid="MAT 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Unochilisa Mapofu Mabili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27" />Akale Jesu wakati ekwenda endila mbeli epinda yopo, mapofu mabili bakontobela, beshomeja beti, “Mwananhulumyana waDavidi, tiwhile ishe!”<verse eid="MAT 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28" />Angwina mungumba, mapofu bakenda kunaiye, Jesu akati kwabali, “Munodimbwa kuti ndingatubula kuta yezwi na”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:28">Bakati kwaali, “Eya, Tezi.”<verse eid="MAT 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29" />Kova eguma mesho abo, eti, “Ngezwitike kwamuli sokudimbwa kwenu.” <verse eid="MAT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30" />Mesho abo akazhulika bakabona. Jesu wakabalaya zwinesimba, eti, “Akutokwelela kuti pebe nonhu uchazwiziba yezwi.”<verse eid="MAT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31" />Koga pabakabhuda yopo, bakamwalaja impuwo yiye munyika yeyo yose.<verse eid="MAT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu unochilisa unhu usakabelebeleka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32" />Bechinobhuda kuti bende, pakalepo, kwakabuzwa kwaali usakabelebeleka wakaba elinamadimoni. <verse eid="MAT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33" />Palyakabhiswa idimoni, usakabelebeleka wakalebeleka, mabunga akashama, eti, “Apana zwakadai zwanu zwabonwa muIzilayeli.”<verse eid="MAT 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34" />Koga baFalisi bakati, “Unobhisa madimoni nesimba lyontungamili wamadimoni.”<verse eid="MAT 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Unowhila Ishe Banhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35" />Akale Jesu wakangwina mumakuta nomumizi yose, elayija mumasinagogo abo, akale ebhaunula iNdebo iMbuya yobushe bokudenga, echilisa malwaji wose namanyajo ose. <verse eid="MAT 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36" />Paakabona mabunga abanhu, wakabawhila ishe, nokuti bakabaka shungulujwa akale bakajiila beli semhwizi jisina undyisi. <verse eid="MAT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37" />Kova eti kubalayijwa babe, “Kuvuna kukulwana, koga bashingi bashoma, <verse eid="MAT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38" />nokudalo namatani kunaTezi mweni wegoloka kuti etumije bashingi koovuna igoloka lilye.”<verse eid="MAT 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10" />
  <para style="s">Balayijwa baligumi nababili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mako 3:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luka 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1" />Wakashoba balayijwa babe bali gumi nababili, akabapa isimba pezhulu pemipepo mibi kuti beibhise, nesimba lyokuchilisa bulwaji bwose bunonyaja mbili. <verse eid="MAT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2" />Mazina abapositoli baligumi nababili ndiwo yaya, wokutanga ndiSimoni unowhi Pita, naEndulu mwanakwaina uwe, Jemusi mwananhulumyana waZebhediya, naJoni ununa uwe, <verse eid="MAT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3" />naFilipu, naBhatilomeyo, naTomasi, naMateo untelesi, naJemusi mwananhulumyana waAlufiyasi, naTadeyusi, <verse eid="MAT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4" />naSimoni wamakatakata, naJudasi Sikaliyoti, wakacheta Jesu.<verse eid="MAT 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutumwa kwabalayijwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mako 6:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luka 9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5" />Yaba igumi nababili, Jesu wakabatuma, akabalaya eti, “Musinde pelyo naBokuzhe, musingwine muguta lyabaSamaliya, <verse eid="MAT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6" />Koga indani kumhwizi jakalashika bali baIzilayeli.” <verse eid="MAT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7" />Pamunokwenda, bhaunulani muti, “Bushe bwedenga bwaba pelyo.” <verse eid="MAT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8" />Chilisani banolwala, chenesani banamapelembuji, musani bakafa, mubhise madimoni nokuti yezwi mwakazwipiwa pesina indipo, namwibo zwipeni pachena. <verse eid="MAT 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9" />Musinyamule indalama, isiliva, imhangula kana makobeli muhobhodo jenu, <verse eid="MAT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10" />musinyamule chikwama palwendo lwenu, zwimbalo zwibili, zwikwabaila, iswimbo, nokuti unshingi unokwelela kuwana indipo.<verse eid="MAT 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11" />Lyose iguta, kana unsha wamunongwina, pyangani yopo palokwelela bwezi bwenu, mugale pakale kuswikila mwakwenda. <verse eid="MAT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12" />Pamunongwina mumba, bamuseni. <verse eid="MAT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13" />Kana ingumba ikakwelela, lunyalalo lwenu ngalube mukati, koga kana isilokwelela, lunyalalo lwenu ngalubwilile kunamwi. <verse eid="MAT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14" />Kana umwe esamutambula akale esinowhilila mawhi enu, kuhumulani ihuluba pamakumbo enu pamunobebhuda muneyo ingumba kana iguta. <verse eid="MAT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15" />Chokomende ndinoti kwamuli; Nezhuba lyontongo, inyika yeSodoma neGomola inoolelupilwa kupinda yelyo iguta.<verse eid="MAT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusheteswa kwabatumwa baMwali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16" />Lingani, ndomutuma semhwizi mukati mwamapele, nokudalo chenjelani senyoka akale mube babuya senjiba. <verse eid="MAT 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17" />Bachenjeleleni banhu, nokuti banoomusenga mbeli kwamakota, kova bemunabha mumasinagogo abo, <verse eid="MAT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18" />Munoosengwa kubatongi nokumashe pezhulu pangu, kuti mooba basumikiji kwabali nokuna Bokuzhe. <verse eid="MAT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19" />Kana bamusenga musizwinyaje kuti molebeleka chini, kana kuti monolebeleka mutini, nokuti panoyo nshaji munoopiwa zwamuchaleba, <verse eid="MAT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20" />nokuti amutoba imwi muchalebeleka, koga uMpepo waTate benu ndiye unoolebeleka nomunamwi.<verse eid="MAT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21" />Mwanakwaina unoopila mwanakwaina uwe kuti ebulayiwe, natate banoodalo kumwana wabo. Bana banoomukila bazwali babo nokubabulayisa. <verse eid="MAT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22" />Munoobengwa nabose pezhulu pezina lyangu, asi iye unooma akasima kuswikila kumapejelejo ndiye uchoochijwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23" />Kana muyangatiswa muguta munalimwe iguta, tizhilani kunelimwe guta, chokomende, ndolebesa nditi kwamuli, “Amutoopeja kungwina mumakuta ose omuIzilayeli esanu aswika Mwananhulumyana woNhu.”<verse eid="MAT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24" />Undayijwa aangabe pezhulu pondayiji uwe, kana nshingi kuba pezhulu patezi uwe. <verse eid="MAT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25" />Zwilokwana kuti undayijwa ebe sondayiji uwe, nonshingi ebe satezi uwe. Kana beshoba mweni wengumba beti ndiBheluzabheli, namwibo banomulebela bubi bukulwana imwi bengumba iye.<verse eid="MAT 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unokwelela kutyiwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:2-7">Luka 12:2-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26" />“Nokudalo lekani kubatya, nokuti apana zwilofumikwa zwichoolekwa kuti zwibhiswe pachena, kana zwilosisika zwichooleka kuzibwa, <verse eid="MAT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27" />Zwandinomubuja munhilima, zwilebeni pachena, zwamunowha benyebeza, zwilebeni mulipezhulu pedenga lyengumba. <verse eid="MAT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28" />Musitye yabo banobulaya umbili koga besinotubula kubulaya umpepo, asi ityani kasa yoyo unamasimba okupalaja umpepo nombili mugehena, <verse eid="MAT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29" />Tutiti tubili atutotengeswa nepeni na? Koga apana kangawila pasi Tate benu besinoda. <verse eid="MAT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30" />Koga nevuji lyose lyomunsholo mwenu lilobalwa, <verse eid="MAT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31" />Nokudalo musitye, imwi mulokosha kupinda tutiti tunji.<verse eid="MAT 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuvumila nokulamba Kristo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:8">Luka 12:8</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 12:9">9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32" />“Akale unhuwose unondipupula pambeli pabanhu, namibo ndinoompupula pambeli paTate bangu baiko kudenga. <verse eid="MAT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33" />Asi wose unondilamba pambeli pabanhu, namibo ndinoondamba pambeli paTate bangu baiko kudenga.<verse eid="MAT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu unobuza lubengo pakati pabanhu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:51-53">Luka 12:51-53</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:26">14:26</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 14:27">27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34" />“Musiyeye kuti ndakezha kwobuza lunyalalo penyika, andijakezha kwobuza lunyalalo, koga igwalabaza. <verse eid="MAT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35" />Nokuti ndakezha koopambulanya mwananhululumyana natate babe, mwananhukajana namai babe, nonkajiwomwana namezwale babe. <verse eid="MAT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36" />Babengi bonhu banobeli yabo bemhuli yiye.<verse eid="MAT 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37" />“Iye unoda tate babe namai babe kupinda imi, aajilokwelela kuba wangu, neebo iye unoda mwananhulumyana uwe, kana mwananhukajana uwe, kupinda imi, aajilokwelela kuba wangu. <verse eid="MAT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38" />Aani nani usinotola unchinjikwa uwe enditobele, aajilokwelela kuba wangu. <verse eid="MAT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39" />Yoyo unowana bupenyu bubwe, bunoondashikila, koga aani nani unolashikilwa nobupenyu bubwe pezhulu pangu, unoobuwana.<verse eid="MAT 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupiwa umbhailo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:41">Mako 9:41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40" />“Iye unomutambula, unobetambula imi, neebo iye unotambula imi unotambula iye wakandituma. <verse eid="MAT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41" />Iye unotambula umpolofeti nokuti umpolofeti, unoopiwa indipo yompolofeti, nooyo unotambula unhu wakalulama nokuti unhu ulolulama, unoopiwa indipo yonhu wakalulama. <verse eid="MAT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42" />Wose unhu unopa unkombe wevula inotonhola kunomwe wabatukutuku yaba pezhulu pokuti undayijwa wangu, chokomende, ndinoti kwamuli aatoyishayiwa indipo iye.”<verse eid="MAT 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11" />
  <para style="s">Inhumwa JaJoni Umbhabhatizi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Luka 7:18-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1" />Jesu paakati apeja kupa indayijo kubalayijwa babe bali gumi nababili, wakenda kunolayija nokubhaunula mumakuta abo.<verse eid="MAT 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2" />Joni paakawha nozwemishingo yaKristo eli muntolongo, wakatumila balayijwa babe, <verse eid="MAT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3" />akati kwaali, “Ndiwi na yoyo wakawhi unoozha, kana kuti tilingilile umwe”<verse eid="MAT 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4" />Jesu wakabashandula akati, “Indani munoombuja Joni zwamuwhile nezwamumubona, kuti, <verse eid="MAT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5" />mapofu akumutubula kubona, namakosha akumukwenda, banabulwaji bwamapelembuji bakumucheneswa, nabamachinzebe bakumuwha, nabakafa bakumumuswa, nabasheti bakumubujwa iNdebo iMbuya. <verse eid="MAT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6" />Ulokombolelwa yoyo usinokahajika nokuda kwangu.”<verse eid="MAT 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7" />Pabakati benda, Jesu wakatanga kulebeleka nezwaJoni kubunga, eti, “Mwakenda kugwegulu kunobonani? Idete limuteketeswa nebhepo na” <verse eid="MAT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8" />Ani mwakenda kunobona ani? Unhu ulombala zwimbalo zwibuyanana na? Bonani, yabo banombala zwimbalo zwibuyanana ndibo banogala mujingumba jamashe <verse eid="MAT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9" />Ani mwakabendilani? Kunobona umpolofeti na? Eya ndinomubuja, unopinda umpolofeti. <verse eid="MAT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10" />Yoyu ndiye ulokwalwa nezwizwe kuwhi, “Bonani ndinootuma untumwa wangu pambeli papo uchoolulamisa inzila yiyo.” <verse eid="MAT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11" />Chokomende ndinoti kwamuli, mukati mwaabo bakazwalwa nonhukaji apana unkulwana kupinda Joni umBhabhatizi, koga yoyo untukutuku mubushe bwedenga ndiye unkulwana kuna iye. <verse eid="MAT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12" />Kuva mumazhuba aJoni umBhabhatizi kuswikila ngweno, bushe bwedenga bwayangata nolunya, akale banhu banalunya bamubutola nesimba. <verse eid="MAT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13" />Nokuti bapolofeti bose nomulawo bakapolofita kuswikila panaJoni. <verse eid="MAT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14" />Kana muzwitambula, iye ndiye Elija wakapolofitwa kuwhi unoozha. <verse eid="MAT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15" />Unenzebe ngewhe!<verse eid="MAT 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16" />“Koga, ndochikwelanisa neni, chizekululu yechi?” Chinanga sabana bagele pamusika banoshobelela kunabamwe babo beti, <verse eid="MAT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17" />“Takamulijila inyele koga amujakazana, takamulilila koga amujakafwikula, <verse eid="MAT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18" />Nokuti Joni wakezha esinolya, esinonwa bakati, ‘unedimoni.’ <verse eid="MAT 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19" />Mwananhulumyana woNhu wakezha elya, enwa ibo bakati, ‘ilingani unhu ibhazwi nechinwi, unkwaina wabatelesi nabachinyi!’ Koga buchenjeli bunoboneka nezwito zwazwo.”<verse eid="MAT 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makuta abasakabakadimbwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Luka 10:13-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20" />Jesu wakakalalila makuta mwaakata zwichenamiso zwikulwana, nokuti ajakashanduka. <verse eid="MAT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21" />Wakati, “Mayee kunamwi Kolazini! Mayee kunamwi Bhetisaida! Ngana zwishamiso zwakatiwa munamwi, zwili zwakabatilwa muTile nomuSidoni, ngana bakashanduka kale, bekambala masaka nokuguba ilota. <verse eid="MAT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22" />Koga ndinomubuja kuti kunooba kubhodo nezhuba lyokutonga kuTile neSidoni kupinda imwi. <verse eid="MAT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23" />Ani iwi Kapenaume, unoonyamulilwa kudenga na? Mane, unoosengwa pasi kuHadesi bugalo bwabakafa, nokuti zwishamiso zwakatiwa mwauli ngana zwakabatilwa muSodoma, ngana nasi ilipo. <verse eid="MAT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24" />Koga ndinoti kwamuli, nezhuba lyokutongwa kunooba kubhodo kunyika yeSodoma kupinda kwauli.”<verse eid="MAT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Izhani kunami muwane kunyetutuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:21">Luka 10:21</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 10:22">22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25" />Nonshaji yoyo Jesu wakati, “Ndinomuboka Tate Tezi wedenga nenyika, nokuti mwakasisa yezwi kunayabo banabuchenjevu nabana luzibo, asi mukazwibhisa pachena kunaabo bananga sabana batukutuku. <verse eid="MAT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26" />Eya, Tate, yoku kwakabeli kuda kwenu kwaShe.”<verse eid="MAT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27" />Zwinhu zwose zwakabigwa kwandili naTate bangu, akuna unoziba Mwananhulumyana asi Tate chete, akale akuna unoziba Tate, kuzhe koMwananhulumyana chete, naabo banobashalwa noMwananhulumyana kuti oontondeje.<verse eid="MAT 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28" />“Izhani kwandili imwi mulonyala nokusenga mitolo milemu, ndoomupa lunyetutuko. <verse eid="MAT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29" />Nyamulani ijogwe lyangu, mulayijwe kuva kwandili, nokuti ndinyolonyolo akale ndinamwoyo umbuyanana, munoowana kunyetutuka kwemipepo yenu. <verse eid="MAT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30" />Nokuti ijogwe lyangu ilelu, nontolo wangu undelu.”<verse eid="MAT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12" />
  <para style="s">Umbhuzo Pezhulu Pezhuba LyeSabata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mako 2:23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luka 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1" />Panoyo unshaji Jesu wakapinda nomuminda nezhuba lyokunyetutukwa lyabaJuda linowhi Sabata, balayijwa babe bakabeli nenzhala, nokudalo bakatanga kupulula zwilyo belya. <verse eid="MAT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2" />Asi baFalisi pabakazwibona yezwi bakati kwaali, “Bona, balayijwa babo bakumuta zwisinovumijwa nezhuba lyeSabata.”<verse eid="MAT 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3" />Wakati kwabali, “Amujanu mwabala na zwakatiwa naDavidi paakafa nenzhala eli naabo bakabeli naye” <verse eid="MAT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4" />Wakangwina mungumba yaMwali, akalya zwinkwa zwakabeli umpilo kunaMwali, pamwempela naabo bakabeli naye, kojoba zwisakabevumilwa mumulawo, kuzhe kwabatebuji chete. <verse eid="MAT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5" />Ani amujakabala mumulawo na kuti batebuji banotaluka mulawo weSabata muTempeli besinopiwa undandu? <verse eid="MAT 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6" />Ndinomubuja kuti, yopa pana umwe unkulwana unopinda iTempeli. <verse eid="MAT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7" />Ngana mwaluziba kuti yezwi zwinolebani zwokuti, “Ndinoda ishe andidi umpilo, ngana musinobatonga basina undandu. <verse eid="MAT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8" />Nokuti Mwananhulumyana woNhu ndiye Tezi weSabata.”<verse eid="MAT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unhulume unaluboko lulokokonyala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mako 3:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luka 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9" />Wakava yopo akanongwina musinagogi yabo. <verse eid="MAT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10" />Yomo mwakabeli nonhu ulokokonyala luboko. Bakombhuza beti, “Kunovumijwa na kuchilisa nezhuba lyeSabata?” Betila kuti bompe undandu.<verse eid="MAT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11" />Wakati kwabali, “Ndiani pakati penu unoti eli nemhwizi imwempela inoti kana yawila mudizwa nezhuba lyeSabata, esinonda kunoibhisa na? <verse eid="MAT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12" />Unhu ulokosha kupinda imhwizi! Nokudalo zwinovumilwa kuta zwibuyanana nezhuba lyeSabata.” <verse eid="MAT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13" />Kova eti kunoyo unhu, “Tambunuja luboko lulwo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 12:13">Wakalutambunuja, lukava lwachiliswa, lukaba solumwe. <verse eid="MAT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14" />Koga baFalisi bakabhuda bakanogala pasi bepota inzila yokuumbulaya.<verse eid="MAT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unshingi uloshalwa waMwali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15" />Jesu paakazwiziba yezwi, wakabhuda yopo. Banhu banji bakontobela akabachilisa bose, <verse eid="MAT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16" />ekabalayila kuti besibuje banhu, nezwizwe. <verse eid="MAT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17" />Yezwi zwakabezhajikija zwakalebwa nompolofeti Izaya kuti, <verse eid="MAT 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18" />“Bonani unshingi wangu unodikanwa, wandakashala iye unondishantisa. Ndobiga uMpepo wangu pezhulu pape, naiye unooshobelela indulamo kuna bokuzhe. <verse eid="MAT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19" />Aatonyenyeja, kana kuta izhoba, akuna uchawha iwhi lilye mumigwagwa, <verse eid="MAT 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20" />Aatovuna lushanga lwakasubulwa, kana kujima kamunikiso kamumwinikija, kuswikila indulamo yazunda zwose. <verse eid="MAT 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21" />Muzina lilye banhu bokuzhe banoobimba naye.”<verse eid="MAT 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu naBheluzabheli.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:20-30">Mako 3:20-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luka 11:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22" />Bakabuza kwaali unhu waluba nedimoni, eli ibhofu akale esinotubula kulebeleka, wakonchilisa, mane unhu wakabesinolebeleka akalebeleka nokubona. <verse eid="MAT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23" />Banhu bose bakachenama bakati, “Angaba Mwananhulumyana waDavidi na yoyu”<verse eid="MAT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24" />Asi pabakati bazwiwha, baFalisi bakati, “Yoyu unhu unobhisa madimoni nesimba lyaBheluzabheli, tezi wemipepo mibi.”<verse eid="MAT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25" />Wakazwiziba zwakabeli mundangalilo jabo akati kwabali, “Bwose bushe buloganulanwa pakati, bunopalajwa akale apana iguta kana ingumba iloganulwana ingoma.” <verse eid="MAT 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26" />Kana Satani ebhisa Satani, uloganukana nokukwe, bushe bubwe bungama chini? <verse eid="MAT 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27" />Kana Imi ndibhisa madimoni nesimba lyaBheluzabheli, ani bana benu banowabhisa nesimba lyani? Nokudalo banooba batongi benu. <verse eid="MAT 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28" />Koga kana eli uMpepo waMwali wandinobhisa naye madimoni, zibani kuti bushe bwaMwali bwaswika kwamuli.<verse eid="MAT 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29" />Kana unhu angangwina chini mungumba yonhu unesimba, epamba zwibiya zwizwe, kuzhe kwokuti etange asunga yoyo unamasimba? Ndipo paachapamba ingumba yiye.<verse eid="MAT 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30" />Yoyo usiko kunami unokakabajana nami, nayoyo usinobunganisa nami ndiye unotataula. <verse eid="MAT 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31" />Nokudalo ndinoti kwamuli, unhu unolekejelwa luchinyo lwose nokutuka Mwali, asi kutuka uMpepo uNchena akutolekejelwa. <verse eid="MAT 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32" />Wose unolebeleka iwhi ibi pezhulu poMwananhulumyana woNhu unolekejelwa, koga yoyo unolebeleka iwhi ibi pezhulu poMpepo uNchena aatolekejelwa, nonshaji yono kana munshaji unozha.<verse eid="MAT 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unti Nonchelo Wawo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-45">Luka 6:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33" />“Itani kuti unti ube umbuyanana nemichelo yawo inooba mibuyanana, kana kuta kuti unti ube umbi, nemichelo yawo inooba mibi, nokuti unti zwauli unoboneka nemichelo yawo. <verse eid="MAT 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34" />Imwi bana benyoka! Mungalebeleka chini mawhi mabuya imwi muli babi? Nokuti undomo unobhisa zwizhele mumwoyo. <verse eid="MAT 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35" />Unhu umbuya unobhisa zwinhu zwibuya kuva mumwoyo uwe umbuya, nonhu umbi unobhisa zwinhu zwibi kuva mumwoyo uwe umbi.”<verse eid="MAT 12:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36" />“Ndinoti kwamuli, nezhuba lyokutongwa, banhu bose banoozwishandulila bomene pezhulu pamawhi asina unshingo abanolebeleka, <verse eid="MAT 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37" />nokuti pezhulu pamawhi awo, unoosungunulwa, akale namawhi awo unoolashwa.”<verse eid="MAT 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuda Chichenamiso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11">Mako 8:11</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 8:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Luka 11:29-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38" />Bamwe babakwali nabaFalisi bakati kwaali, “Ndayiji tinoda kubona chichenamiso chinova kwauli.”<verse eid="MAT 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39" />Koga wakabashandula akati, “Chizekululu chababipisi nabapomboli chinoshaka chichenamiso, koga achitoopiwa chichenamiso, do chichenamiso chaJona umpolofeti. <verse eid="MAT 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40" />Nokuti saJona waluba muntumbu mwehobe kwamazhuba matatu nobusiku butatu, neebo ndizwo zwichatikana kuMwananhulumyana woNhu unooba muvu mazhuba matatu nobusiku butatu. <verse eid="MAT 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41" />Banhu bokuNinive banoonyamuka nezhuba lyokutongwa pamwempela nechizekululu yechi, akale banoochitonga, nokuti ibo bakashanduka pabakawha kubhaunula kwaJona, koga ilingani, pana unhu unkulwana kupinda Jona yopano. <verse eid="MAT 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42" />Shekaji wokuChamhembe unoonyamuka pakutongwa kwechi chizekululu akale echilasha, nokuti wakava kumigano yenyika koowha buchenjevu bwaSolomoni, koga ilingani, pana unhu unkulwana kupinda Solomoni yopano.”<verse eid="MAT 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubhuda kwompepo umbi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:24-26">Luka 11:24-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43" />“Kana umpepo umbi wabhuda ponhu, unokwendenda mugwegulu upyanga pokugala, uchiko pashayiwa. <verse eid="MAT 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44" />Ngweno unoti, ‘Ndinobwilila kungumba yangu kwandakabhuda. Paunobwilila unowana musina zwimo, yakapyailwa akale yakalonganywa.’ <verse eid="MAT 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45" />Unova wenda kunotola mimwe mipepo mishanu inamibili, mibi kupinda iwo, itukogala mukati, kumapejisilo onhu yoyo kunoba kubi kupinda pakutanga. Ndizwo zwichooba chizekululu yechi chibi.”<verse eid="MAT 12:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amai Nabanuna baJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mako 3:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luka 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46" />Jesu echinolebeleka nabanhu, amai nabanuna babe bakabelimile pazhe beda kulebeleka naye. <verse eid="MAT 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47" />Umwe wakati kuna iye, “Haba amai babo nabanuna babo bamile pazhe bamuda kulebeleka nawi.”<verse eid="MAT 12:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48" />Koga iye wakashandula yoyo wakombuja eti, “Amai bangu ndiani na? Nabanuna bangu ndibani na?” <verse eid="MAT 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49" />Wakatambunuja luboko kubalayijwa babe eti, “Haba amai nabanuna bangu! <verse eid="MAT 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50" />Nokuti aani naani unota kuda kwaTate bangu bokudenga ndiye nkazwaji wechinhulume, nowechinhukaji namai bangu.”<verse eid="MAT 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13" />
  <para style="s">Unkwejaniso wombyali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mako 4:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luka 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1" />Nelyo izhuba Jesu wakabhuda mungumba, akanogala mumbali mwegungwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2" />Ibunga igulwana lyakaumbunganila, zwikatisa kuti engwine mubwato akagala mukati, ibunga lyose lyakama pebhambo. <verse eid="MAT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3" />Wakababuja zwinhu zwinji nemikwejaniso, eti,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:3">“Umbyali wakenda kunobyala. <verse eid="MAT 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4" />Akale ebyala imwe imbeyu yakawila munzila, kova inyuni jizha, akale jikailya. <verse eid="MAT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5" />Imwe yembeyu yakawila pamwala, nokukambija yakamela sezwo pakaba pesina ivu inji, <verse eid="MAT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6" />asi izhuba palyakabhuda, yakapya ikahwihwinyala, nokuti yaluba isina miji. <verse eid="MAT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7" />Imwe imbeyu yakawila mumiwha, koga miwha ikakubuka ikayimanikija. <verse eid="MAT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8" />Imwe imbeyu yakawila muvu ibuyanana, ikazwala kasakasa, imwe izana, imwe makumi mashanu ane limwempela, imwe makumi matatu.<verse eid="MAT 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9" />“Iye une nzebe ngewhe.”<verse eid="MAT 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chinangwa chokulayija nemikwejaniso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mako 4:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9">Luka 8:9</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 8:10">10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10" />Kova balayijwa babe bezha beti kwaali, “Ini ulebeleka nemikwejaniso kwabali”<verse eid="MAT 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11" />Akale wakabashandula eti, “Imwi mwakapiwa kuziba zwilosisika nezwobushe bokudenga, koga kwabali abajakapiwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12" />Nokuti kunoyo unanazwo unoopiwa zwinji, koga yoyo usina, unootolelwa yozwo zwaananazwo. <verse eid="MAT 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13" />Ndizwo ndilebeleka nabo nemikwejaniso, nokuti kojoba bebona, abatobonesesa, akale nokuwha abatowha, kana kuwhisisisa. <verse eid="MAT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14" />Zwipindila munaibo kuti kuzhajikijwe zwakapolofitwa naIzaya eti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">“Munoowha kasa, asi amutoowhisisa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:14">munoobona kasa, koga amutoobonesesa,<verse eid="MAT 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15" />Nokudalo myoyo yabanhu yakaba mikukutu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">nenzebe jabo jinowhila kule,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">akale balofwinya mesho abo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">Kutila kuti besibone</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">namesho abo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">nokuwha nenzebe jabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">nokuwhisisa nemyoyo yabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">akale kuti besishandukile kwandili kuti ndibachilise.”<verse eid="MAT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16" />Koga alokombolelwa mesho enu, nokuti anobona, nenzebe jenu nokuti jinowha. <verse eid="MAT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17" />“Chokomende, ndinoti kwamuli banji bapolofeti nabanhu bakalulama bakaba beda kubona yezwi zwamubweni, asi abajakazwibona, akale nokuwha zwamuwhile, akale abajakazwiwha.”<verse eid="MAT 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu unopandulula unkwejaniso wombyali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mako 4:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luka 8:11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18" />Iwhani unkwejaniso wombyali. <verse eid="MAT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19" />Kana unhu ewha iwhi lyobushe bokudenga, asi esinoliwhisisa, umbi unozha kova evupula zwakabyalwa mumwoyo uwe, yezwi ndizwo zwakababyalwa munzila. <verse eid="MAT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20" />Koga yeyo yakabyalwa pamwala ndiyo inowha iwhi, ikalitambula nokukambija nolushanto, <verse eid="MAT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21" />asi aana miji mwaali, unobhatilila pashoma, kungoswika masheto kana kuyangatiswa pezhulu pewhi, unokambija kulilasha. <verse eid="MAT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22" />Yeyo yakabyalwa pakati pemiwha, ndiye unowha iwhi, asi kunyajwa nozwenyika nokuchengela kwefuma kunojipa iwhi, nokudalo ayitozwala unchelo. <verse eid="MAT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23" />Kuneyo yakabyalwa muvu ibuyanana, ndiye unowha iwhi, kova eliwhisisa, unozwala michelo, zwinoba izana pamwe makumi mashanu ane limwe, pamwe makumi matatu.<verse eid="MAT 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unkwejaniso wedihwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24" />Jesu wakabapa umwe unkwejaniso, eti, “Bushe bwedenga bungakwejaniswa nonhu wakabyala imbeyu imbuya muminda uwe.” <verse eid="MAT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25" />Asi banhu belilele, chita chiche chakezha chikabyala idihwa mukati mwekoloni iye, chikenda. <verse eid="MAT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26" />Payakamela imbeyu, yakazwala zwilyo, neebo idihwa lyakaboneka bo. <verse eid="MAT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27" />Bashingi babe bakezha kuna iye bakati, ‘tezi amujakabyala imbeyu imbuya muminda wenu na? Ani biya idihwa lyakavapi?’ <verse eid="MAT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28" />‘Wakati kwabali, zwakatiwa nombengi.’ Bashingi bakati kwaali, ‘Unoda na kuti tinde tinobhisa tibunganise idihwa na?’ <verse eid="MAT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29" />Asi iye wakati, “pe, nokuti pamuchaba mubunganisa idihwa, mungoobhisikija nekoloni. <verse eid="MAT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30" />Lekani zwose zwikubukile pamwempela kuswikila unshaji wokuvuna. Nonshaji wokuvuna ndinooti kubavuni, ‘tangisani kubunganisa idihwa, mulisunge pamwempela kuti lipiswe, koga ikoloni muyibige mugombana lyangu.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unkwejaniso wembeyu yemasitadi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mako 4:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18">Luka 13:18</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 13:19">19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31" />Wakababuja umwe unkwejaniso, eti, “Bushe bwedenga bunokwelana nembeyu inhukutuku inowhi imasitadi yakatolwa nonhu akenda nayo akanoyibyala muminda uwe. <verse eid="MAT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32" />Iyo inhukutuku kasa kumbeyu jose, asi ingokubuka, inobehulwana kupinda matenje ose, kova iba unti, inyuni jomumpepo kova jizha jibaka zwizhumbo penhabi jawo.”<verse eid="MAT 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unkwejaniso wonkukumuso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:20">Luka 13:20</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 13:21">21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33" />Jesu wakababuja umwe unkwejaniso, eti, “Bushe bwedenga bunanga sonkukumuso wakatolwa nowechinhukajana, eshanganisa nenjela inhatu jekoloni, wakafufumusa injela jose.”<verse eid="MAT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kushingisa mikwejaniso kwaJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:33">Mako 4:33</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 4:34">34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34" />Zwose yezwi Jesu wakazwileba kumabunga nemikwejaniso, chokomende apana chaakaleba pesina unkwejaniso kunaibo. <verse eid="MAT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35" />Nokuta alo yoku kwakabeli kuzhajikija zwakabalebelekwa nompolofeti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:35">“Ndoozhula undomo wangu nemikwejaniso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:35">ndoolebeleka zwakabakasisika kuvila kumatangisilo enyika.”<verse eid="MAT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu unopandulula unkwejaniso wedihwa muminda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36" />Jesu wakasiya mabunga akangwina mungumba. Balayijwa babe bakondila, beti, “Tipandululile unkwejaniso wedihwa muminda.”<verse eid="MAT 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37" />Wakabashandula, eti, “Iye unobyala imbeyu imbuya Mwananhulumyana woNhu, <verse eid="MAT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38" />minda inyika, imbeyu imbuyanana ndibo bana bobushe, asi idihwa ndibo bana baGuluzhanje. <verse eid="MAT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39" />Umbengi wakaibyala ndiGuluzhanje, kuvuna ndiko kupela kwenyika, bavuni ingilozi. <verse eid="MAT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40" />Sokubunganiswa kunotiwa idihwa akale lipiswa nomoto, kunoba alo pakupela kwenyika. <verse eid="MAT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41" />Mwananhulumyana woNhu unootuma ingilozi jije, akale jinoobunganya jibhise mubushe bubwe zwose zwinobuza luchinyo naibo bose bachinyi, <verse eid="MAT 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42" />jinoobaposela mubibi lyomoto, yokwo kunoba nokulila nokulya ntwino. <verse eid="MAT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43" />Kova bakalulama bepenya sezhuba mubushe bwaTate babo. Yoyo unenzebe ngewhe!”<verse eid="MAT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unkwejaniso wefuma ilosiswa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44" />Jesu wakati, “bushe bwokudenga bunanga sefuma ilosiswa muminda, yakawanikwa nonhu kova eyisisa, mulushanto lulwe kova etengesa zwose zwaananazo, etenga unda yoyo.”<verse eid="MAT 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unkwejaniso wobulungu Bulokosha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45" />“Akale bushe bokudenga bunanga sonshambaji ukumupyanga bulungu bulokosha. <verse eid="MAT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46" />Abuwana bulungu bulokosha, wakenda akatengesa zwose zwaakabeli nazwo akabutenga.”<verse eid="MAT 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unkwejaniso wevubo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47" />“Akale bushe bwedenga bunanga sevubo lyakaposwa mugungwa, likabhata ihobe jenduji jose, <verse eid="MAT 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48" />palyakati lyazhala, banhu bakalikakatila kumbali, bakagala pasi beshaluja imbuyanana bebiga muzwibigilo asi imbi bejilasha. <verse eid="MAT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49" />Kunooba alo pakupela kwenyika. Ingilozi jinoobhuda, jinda jishaluja babi mukati mwabakalulama, <verse eid="MAT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50" />jibaposela mubibi lyomoto, yomo banhu banoolila nokuluma ntwino abo.<verse eid="MAT 13:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zwipya Nezwantolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51" />“Mwazwiwhisisa zwose yezwi na”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:51">Bakati kwaali, “Eya.”<verse eid="MAT 13:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52" />Akale wakati kwabali, “Nokudalo unkwali wose, wakalayijilwa bushe bwedenga, unanga somweni wonzi unobhisa muchuma chiche zwipya nezwantolo.”<verse eid="MAT 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu unolambwa muNazaleta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mako 6:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luka 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53" />Jesu wakati apeja yeyi mikwejaniso, wakabhuda yopo akenda, <verse eid="MAT 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54" />akale aswika kuNazaleta kubugalo bokunaibo, wakabalaija musinagogi lyabo, zwakabachenamisa, bakati, “Yoyu unhu wakabuwanapi buchenjevu bwakadai, neyi mishingo yamasimba makulwana? <verse eid="MAT 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55" />Yoyu aatoba iye na mwana wombezhi? Amai babe abatowhi Mariya na? Akale banakwaina babe abatobeli Jemusi, Josefa, Simoni naJudasi na? <verse eid="MAT 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56" />Akale bakazwaji babe bechinhukaji abagele nasu na? Yoyu unhu wakazwiwana kupi zwose yezwi?” <verse eid="MAT 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57" />Bakonyemela.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:57">Koga Jesu wakati kwabali, “Umpolofeti aana kukujwa kubugalo bokunaibo akale nokumhuli yokunaibo.” <verse eid="MAT 13:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58" />Aajakata zwishamiso zwinji yokwo, pezhulu pokusodimbwa kwabo.<verse eid="MAT 13:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14" />
  <para style="s">Kubulayiwa kwaJoni umbhabhatizi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mako 6:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luka 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1" />Noyonshaji Helodi untongi, awha nezwempuwo yaJesu, <verse eid="MAT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2" />wakati kubashingi babe, “Yoyu ndiye Joni uMbhabhatizi, wamuswa mubafi, ndizwo isimba lyokuta mishingo lilimunaiye.”<verse eid="MAT 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3" />Nokuti Helodi wakasunga Joni akombiga muntolongo pezhulu paHelodiyasi, unkaji waFilipu, mwanakwaina uwe. <verse eid="MAT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4" />Nokuti Joni wakati kunaiye, “azwimo mumulawo kuti uuntole,” <verse eid="MAT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5" />Kojoba wakabeda kubulaya Joni, koga wakabetya banhu, nokuti bakabountola sompolofeti.<verse eid="MAT 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6" />Koga nezhuba lyokuzwalwa kwaHelodi, mwananhukajana waHelodiyasi wakazana mbeli kwabo, akashantisa Helodi, <verse eid="MAT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7" />mane akoombimbisa nekowhe kuti unompa kana chipizwacho chaachakumbila.<verse eid="MAT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8" />Sokubujwa namai babe, wakati, “Ndipeni ngweno mundyilo unsholo waJoni uMbhabhatizi.”<verse eid="MAT 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9" />She wakawushubala, asi pezhulu pekowhe, akale nabashanyi baluba naye, wakalaya kuti epiwe. <verse eid="MAT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10" />Wakatuma balwi akale Joni kova edumulwa unsholo elimuntolongo, <verse eid="MAT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11" />Akale unsholo uwe wakabuzwa ulimundyilo ukapiwa unsichana, iye akoonsenga kunamai babe. <verse eid="MAT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12" />Balayijwa babe bakezha bakatola untumbu uwe bakonjika, bakenda bakanobuja Jesu.<verse eid="MAT 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu unopa kulya banhu zwiulu zwishanu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mako 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Joni 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13" />Wakati Jesu azwiwha yezwi, wakabhuda yopo nobwato akenda kubugalo bwegwegulu eli ega. Koga ibunga lyabanhu palyakazwiwha, lyakontobela namakumbo liva mumakuta. <verse eid="MAT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14" />Paakabhuluka, wakabona ibunga igulwana lyabanhu, akabawhila ishe, akachilisa banolwala.<verse eid="MAT 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15" />Kwaba madeko, balayijwa babe bakenda kunaiye, bakati, “Lingani yokuno kwatili kuzhe, unshaji wenda, lekejani banhu bende kumisha benotenga kulya kwabo.”<verse eid="MAT 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16" />Jesu wakati, “Abatokwelela kunda, imwi bapeni zwokulya!” <verse eid="MAT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17" />Bakati kunaiye, “Tina zwinkwa zwishanu nehobe imbili chete.”<verse eid="MAT 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18" />Iye akati, “zwibuzeni yokuno kwandili.” <verse eid="MAT 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19" />Wakabuja ibunga lyabanhu kuti ligale pasi pabuhwa, akatola zwinkwa zwishanu nehobe mbili, akalinga kudenga, akazwikombolela, akazwimedula zwinkwa akazwipa kubalayijwa babe, balayijwa bakapa ibunga lyabanhu. <verse eid="MAT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20" />Bose bakalya bakaguta, bakanunga zwifwapi zwakabasala bakazhaja zwizuma igumi nezwibili. <verse eid="MAT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21" />Bose bakalya bakabeswika banhu zwiulu zwishanu zwabanhulume, kusinobalwa banhukaji nabana.<verse eid="MAT 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu unokwenda pezhulu pevula</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mako 6:45-52</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Joni 6:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22" />Pakalepo Jesu wakabuja balayijwa babe kuti bengwine mubwato, bevubukile museli bende mbeli kukwe, iye wakabuja banhu kuti bemwayike. <verse eid="MAT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23" />Wakati abuja banhu kuti bemwayike, wakatanha mudunhu eli ega kunonamata. Kwakati kwaba madeko, iye wakaba eli ega. <verse eid="MAT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24" />Koga bwato bwakabakwenda nshizho kuva kunyika, bwakabe sundilwa yoku noku namakampo nokuti ibhepo lyakabepunga likalingana nabo.<verse eid="MAT 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25" />Kwaba kumijelo wakaswika kwabali, ekwenda namakumbo pezhulu pegungwa, <verse eid="MAT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26" />Balayijwa babe pabakombona ekwenda mugungwa, zwakabatyisa, bakati, “Ishaku!” bakalila mulutyo.<verse eid="MAT 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27" />Pakalepo Jesu wakalebeleka nabo, eti, “Simani, ndimi, musitye.”<verse eid="MAT 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28" />Pita wakashandula, eti, “Tezi, kana uli iwi, leba kuti ndizhe kwauli ndili pezhulu pevula.”<verse eid="MAT 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29" />Wakati, “izha.” Pita wakabhuda mubwato, ekwenda pezhulu pevula, enda kuna Jesu. <verse eid="MAT 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30" />Koga paakabona isimba lyebhepo, wakatya, akatanga kumila, akashomeja eti, “Tezi, ndichije!”<verse eid="MAT 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31" />Nokukambija Jesu wakatambunuja lubokolulwe akoombata, eti kwaali, “Iwi una kudimbwa kutukutuku, ini wakahajika?”<verse eid="MAT 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32" />Pabakangwina mubwato ibhepo lyakanyalala. <verse eid="MAT 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33" />Baluba mubwato bakonamata, beti, “chokomende Iwi uMwananhulumyana waMwali!”<verse eid="MAT 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu unochilisa banolwala munyika yokuGenesaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Mako 6:53-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34" />Pabakati bavubukila museli, bakaswika munyika yeGenesaleti. <verse eid="MAT 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35" />Pabakati bonziba banhu bobugalo yobo kuti ndiani, bakatumila iwhi munyika yeyo yose, bakabuza balwaji bose kunaiye. <verse eid="MAT 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36" />Bakombweta kuti ebavumije kubhata umpeto wechimbalo chiche, banji bakabhata bakachila.<verse eid="MAT 14:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15" />
  <para style="s">Indayijo yamatategulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Mako 7:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1" />Ngweno kwakezha kunaJesu bamwe baFalisi nabakwali beva kuJelusalema, bakati kwaali, <verse eid="MAT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2" />“Ini balayijwa babo besinotobeleja ingalilo yabakulwana? Nokuti abatoshamba maboko pabanolya.”<verse eid="MAT 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3" />Iye wakabashandula eti, “Imwibo ini mutaluka mulawo waMwali pezhulu pengalilo yenu?” <verse eid="MAT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4" />Nokuti Mwali wakalaya eti, “Lemekeja tate namai babo, akale, yoyo unolebeleka bubi natate babe kana amai babe, chokomende ngebulayiwe.” <verse eid="MAT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5" />Koga imwi moti: Aani naani unoti kuna tate babe kana amai babe, yecho chinova kunami chabekwelela kumubhancha umpilo kunaMwali, <verse eid="MAT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6" />iye aachinosungilwa kukuja tate babe, sezwo nokuda kwengalilo yenu, mwata kuti iwhi lyaMwali lisibe nonshingo. <verse eid="MAT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7" />Imwi, bachengeji, Izaya wakapolofita ichokomende pezhulu penu, paakati,<verse eid="MAT 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8" />“Yaba banhu banondikuja nemilomo yabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:8">koga moyo wabo ukokule nami,<verse eid="MAT 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9" />banondinamata zwisinalubhancho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:9">banolayija indayijo inova mundangalilo jabanhu!’”<verse eid="MAT 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zwinhu Zwinoswibhisa Unhu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:14-23">Mako 7:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10" />Jesu wakashobela banhu kwaali akati kwabali, “Iwhani akale muwhisise, <verse eid="MAT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11" />achitoba chinongwina mundomo chinoswibhisa unhu, koga chinova mundomo, yechi ndicho chinoswibhisa unhu.”<verse eid="MAT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12" />Pakalepo balayijwa bakezha kwaali beti, “Unozwiziba na kuti baFalisi babipilwa pabawha yezwi zwalebelekwa?”<verse eid="MAT 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13" />Wakashandula eti, “Chose chibyalwa chisakabyalwa naTate bangu bokudenga chinoosipulwa. <verse eid="MAT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14" />Basiyeni bakadalo, batungamili mapofu. Akale kana ibhofu lingotungamila ibhofu, bose banowila mugwizhana.”<verse eid="MAT 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15" />Koga Pita wakati kwaali, “Pandulula unkwejaniso yoyu kwatili.”<verse eid="MAT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16" />Jesu wakati, “Namwibo amujanu mwawhisisa? <verse eid="MAT 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17" />Amubweni na kuti zwose zwinongwina nopandomo zwinonda muntumbu, zwitukopindilila zwindila mbeli? <verse eid="MAT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18" />Koga zwinobhuda mundomo zwinova mumwoyo, yezwi zwinoswibhisa unhu. <verse eid="MAT 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19" />Nokuti mumwoyo ndimo munova indangalilo imbi, kubulaya, kupombola, buhungu, bubava, busumikiji bwamaniepwa, nokunyeya. <verse eid="MAT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20" />Yezwi ndizwo zwinoswibhisa unhu, koga kulya usashamba maboko akutoswibhisa unhu.”<verse eid="MAT 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luvumilo lonhukaji UNkenani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Mako 7:24-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21" />Jesu wakabhuda kwakale akenda kudunhu lyokuTile neSidoni. <verse eid="MAT 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22" />Akale ilingani, unhukaji uNkenani waluva munyika yeyo wakezha ekwiila eti, “Ndiwhile ishe, Tezi, Mwananhulumyana waDavidi, mwananhukajana wangu ulobhatwa nesimba nedimoni.”<verse eid="MAT 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23" />Koga aajakonshandula kana iwhi limwempela. Akale balayijwa babe bakezha bakombweta beti, “Untatamile nokuti umutitobela ekwiila.”<verse eid="MAT 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24" />Wakashandula eti, “Ndakatumwa chete kumhwizi jakalashika jengumba yaIzilayeli.”<verse eid="MAT 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25" />Asi wakezha, akafhigama mbeli kukwe eti, “Tezi, ndibhanche.”<verse eid="MAT 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26" />Wakashandula eti, “Akujilolulama kuposela imbwa kulya kwabana.”<verse eid="MAT 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27" />Wakati, “Eya, Tezi, kojoba alo, naijo imbwa jinolya tufwapifwapi tunombwelela mudako lyetebuli lyamatezi ajo.”<verse eid="MAT 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28" />Kova Jesu onshandula eti, “Amwe mai, kudimbwa kwenu kukulwana! Ngachitike chido chenu.” Mwananhukajana wabo wakachila pakalepo.<verse eid="MAT 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu unochilisa banhu banji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29" />Kuva yopo Jesu wakakwenda etobeleja igungwa lyeGalili. Akatanha mudunhu, akagala pasi pakalepo. <verse eid="MAT 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30" />Mabunga makulwana akezha kwaali, ezha namakosha, balolwajiswa, mapofu, basinolebeleka, nabamwe banjinji, akale bakababiga pelyo namakumbo awe, akabachilisa, <verse eid="MAT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31" />zwokuti ibunga lyabanhu lyakachenama, pabakabona basinolebeleka belebeleka, balokubajika bebabapumbulu, makosha ekwenda, mapofu ebona, bakatunhumwija Mwali wabaIzilayeli.<verse eid="MAT 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Unopa Kulya Kuzwiulu Zwina Zwabanhu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Mako 8:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32" />Jesu wakashoba balayijwa babe kwaali, akati kunaibo, “Ndinowhila ishe ibunga, nokuti babeli nami kwamazhuba matatu, akale abachina zwokulya, namibo anditoda kubabwiliza nenzhala, nokuti chimwe chilo bangazilika munzila.”<verse eid="MAT 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33" />Akale balayijwa babe bakati kwaali, “Yomuno mugwegulu tozwiwana kupi zwinkwa zwingaguncha ibunga igulwana lyakadai?”<verse eid="MAT 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34" />Jesu wakati kwabali, “Munazwinkwa zwingana”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 15:34">Bakati, “Zwishanu nezwibili notukobe tushomanana.”<verse eid="MAT 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35" />Wakalaya ibunga kuti ligale pasi, <verse eid="MAT 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36" />akatola zwinkwa zwishanu nezwibili nehobe, akaboka, akazwipemula akapa balayijwa babe, balayijwa bakapa mabunga abanhu. <verse eid="MAT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37" />Bose bakalya bakaguta, akale bakabunganisa zwipemu zwakasala, zwikazhaja zwitundu zwishanu nezwibili. <verse eid="MAT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38" />Yabo bakalya, bakababeli banhulume zwiulu zwina, kusinolabwa banhukaji nabana.<verse eid="MAT 15:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39" />Akonekana namabunga, wakangwina mubwato akenda kunyika yokuMagadani.<verse eid="MAT 15:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16" />
  <para style="s">Kuda chitondejo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Mako 8:11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Luka 12:54-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1" />Akale baFalisi nabaSadusi bakezha kunaJesu, koonkweja beti, ebatondeje chitondejo chinova kudenga. <verse eid="MAT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2" />Wakabashandula eti, “Kungoba madeko moti, ‘mamililo okuzhe anobeli mabuya, nokuti idenga ishaba.’ <verse eid="MAT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3" />Akale zhingwanangwana moti, ‘nasi kuzhe kunobeli nebhepo nokuti idenga ishaba akale linotyisa.’ Moziba kubhaunula kulingika kwedenga, koga, amutotubula kubhaunula zwiboneso zwonshaji. <verse eid="MAT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4" />Chizekululu chibi akale chobupomboli chinoda chitondejelo, apana chitondejelo chamuchapiwa kuzhe kwechitondejelo chaJona.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 16:4">Nokudalo wakabasiya akenda.<verse eid="MAT 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unkukumuso wabaFalisi nabaSadusi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Mako 8:14-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5" />Balayijwa babe pabakaswika museli, bakabakanganwa kubuza zwinkwa. <verse eid="MAT 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6" />Jesu wakati kwabali, “Lingisisani akale muchenjelele unkukumuso wabaFalisi nabaSadusi.”<verse eid="MAT 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7" />Bakalebeleka chabochabo beti, “Atijabuza chinkwa.”<verse eid="MAT 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8" />Koga Jesu ezwiziba yezwi wakati, “A banhu banakudimbwa kushoma, ini mulebeleka pakati penu kuti amuna zwinkwa? <verse eid="MAT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9" />Amujanu mwawhisisa nanasi? Amuchinokumbuluka kuti ndakaguncha banhu zwiulu zwishanu nezwinkwa zwishanu, akale kuti zwaluba zwingana zwizuma zwamwakabunganisa? <verse eid="MAT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10" />Kana zwinkwa zwishanu nezwibili zwakaguncha banhu zwiulu zwina, akale zwitundu zwingana zwamwakabunganisa? <verse eid="MAT 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11" />Ini musinowhisisa kuti andijikumuleba nozwezwinkwa? Chenjelelani unkukumuso wabaFalisi nabaSadusi.”<verse eid="MAT 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12" />Ndipo pabakawhisisa kuti aajakabebabuja kuti bechenjelele unkukumuso wechinkwa, koga zwendayijo yabaFalisi nabaSadusi.<verse eid="MAT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pita unopupula Kuti Jesu NdiKristo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Mako 8:27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luka 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13" />Ngweno Jesu paakaswika mudunhu lyeKesaliya Filipu, wakabhuza balayijwa babe eti, “Banhu banoti Mwananhulumyana woNhu ndiani?”<verse eid="MAT 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14" />Ibo bakati, “Bamwe banoti Joni umbhabhatizi, bamwe banoti Elija, bamwe bo banoti Jelemiya, kana umwe wabapolofeti.”<verse eid="MAT 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15" />Wakati kwabali, “Koga imwi munoti ndimi aani?”<verse eid="MAT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16" />Simoni Pita wakashandula eti, “Ndiwi Kristo, Mwananhulumyana waMwali umpenyu.”<verse eid="MAT 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17" />Jesu wakonshandula akati, “Ulokombolelwa iwi, Simoni mwananhulumyana waJona! Nokuti umbili nelopa azwijakutondeja yezwi, asi Tate bangu bayiko kudenga. <verse eid="MAT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18" />Ndokubuja kuti, ndiwi Pita, pamwala yoyu ndoobaka igubungano lyangu, akale masimba olufu aatolizunda. <verse eid="MAT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19" />Ndokupa isimba lyobushe bwedenga, chose chauchasunga penyika, nokudenga chinoosungwa, akale chose chauchasungunula penyika, chichasungunulwa nokudenga.”<verse eid="MAT 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20" />Ndipo paakava alaya nesimba balayijwa babe kuti besibuje kananhu kuti iye ndiye Kristo.<verse eid="MAT 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu unoleba Nezwamasheto Nokufa Kukwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:31-9:1">Mako 8:31—9:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luka 9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21" />Kuva yoyonshaji Jesu wakatanga kubuja balayijwa babe kuti unokwelela kunda kuJelusalema kunosheteswa nozwinhu zwinji nabakulwana, nabatebuji bakulwana, nabakwali bomulawo, akale ebulayiwe, nezhuba lyatatu etukomuswa.<verse eid="MAT 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22" />Kuva yopo, Pita wakonsengela kumbali, akatanga kuunkalalila eti, “Mane, Tezi! Yezwi azwitofa zwatikana kunawi.”<verse eid="MAT 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23" />Iye wakachebuka akati kuna Pita, “Bhuda mushule mwangu, iwi Satani, unkoneji kwandili, nokuti auko kubhazu lyaMwali koga lyabanhu.”<verse eid="MAT 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24" />Ngweno Jesu wakati kubalayijwa babe, “Kana unhu eda kunditobela, ngeezwilamwe, enyamule unchinjikwa uwe, enditobele. <verse eid="MAT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25" />Nokuti yoyo unoda kuchija bupenyu bubwe, unoobulashikilwa, koga yoyo unolashikilwa nobupenyu bubwe nokuda kwangu, unoobuwana. <verse eid="MAT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26" />Zwinobhanchani kuti unhu ewane zwose zwopasi, koga elashikilwe nobupenyu bubwe? Mane pe, nokuti apana zwaungape kuti ubuwane bupya bupenyu. <verse eid="MAT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27" />Nokuti Mwananhulumyana woNhu unoozha nokungaima kwaTate elinengilozi jije, akale kova elipa wose unhu zwinokwendelana nozwaakata. <verse eid="MAT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28" />Chokomende, ndinoti kwamuli, pana bamwe bamile yopa basinoofa, kuswikila babona Mwananhulumyana woNhu ezha mubushe bubwe.”<verse eid="MAT 16:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17" />
  <para style="s">Kungaimiswa kwaJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Mako 9:2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luka 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1" />Mushule mwamazhuba mashanu ana limwempela Jesu wakatola Pita, naJemusi, naJoni unhu nonuna, akatanha nabo idunhu ilefu beli boga. <verse eid="MAT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2" />Wakashandulwa chimo mbeli kwabo, chiso chiche chakapenya sezhuba, zwimbalo zwizwe zwakachena solupenyo. <verse eid="MAT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3" />Akale ilingani kwakaboneka kwabali Mozesi naElija belebeleka naye. <verse eid="MAT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4" />Akale Pita wakati kuna Jesu, “Tezi, zwibuya kuti tipo yopano, kana chilichido chenu, ndobaka zwitumba zwitatu yopano, chimwe chicho, chimwe chaMozesi, akale nechimwe chaElija.”<verse eid="MAT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5" />Echinolebeleka kwakaswika igole linopenya likabafukija, akale iwhi linova mugole lyakati, “Yoyu Mwananhulumyana wangu unodikanwa, unondishantisa kasa, unwhilileni.”<verse eid="MAT 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6" />Balayijwa pabakawha yezwi, bakawila pasi bekatibhama belizhele lutyo. <verse eid="MAT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7" />Koga Jesu wakabandila akabaguma, akati, “Nyamukani, musibe nolutyo.” <verse eid="MAT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8" />Pabakanyamula misholo yabo, abajakabona umwe unhu kuzhe kwaJesu ega.<verse eid="MAT 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9" />Pabakabebhuluka idunhu, Jesu wakabalaya eti, “Musibuje unhu zwamwabona, kuswikila Mwananhulumyana woNhu amuka kubafi.”<verse eid="MAT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10" />Balayijwa bakombhuza, beti, “Ani banolebani bakwali bomulawo kana beti, ‘Elija unokwelela kuzha kutanga?’ ”<verse eid="MAT 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11" />Wakashandula eti, “Elija unoozha, akale unoobwiliza zwinhu zwose muzwakabeli, <verse eid="MAT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12" />koga ndomubuja kuti Elija wakezha kale, akale ibo abajakonziba, koga bakata paali zwose zwibakabeda. Sezwo akale Mwananhulumyana woNhu unoojiila mumaboko abo.”<verse eid="MAT 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13" />Ndipo balayijwa pabakawhisisa kuti wakabeleba Joni uMbhabhatizi.<verse eid="MAT 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu unochilisa umbisana uneDimoni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Mako 9:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luka 9:37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14" />Pabakaswika pakabeli nebunga lyabanhu, unhulume wakezha akafhigama mbeli kukwe akati, <verse eid="MAT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15" />“Tezi, unwhileni ishe mwananhulumyana wangu, nokuti una zwisuntu akale umuyabula kasa, tunjinji unosowila mumoto kana muvula. <verse eid="MAT 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16" />Akale ndombuza kubalayijwa babo, koga abajatubula kuunchilisa.”<verse eid="MAT 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17" />Jesu wakashandula, eti, “A! Chizekulu chisinodimbwa chinaluchinyo, ndooba namwi kuswikila lini? Kuswikila lini ndimutila moyo ndefu? Umbuzeni yokuno kunami.” <verse eid="MAT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18" />Jesu wakalikalalila idimoni, likabhuda mwaali umbiseni, akale akava achila pakalepo.<verse eid="MAT 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19" />Kova balayijwa bezha kunaJesu beli boga, beti, “Ani isu ini zwakoneja kuti tilibhise?”<verse eid="MAT 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20" />Wakati kwabali, “Nokuti kudimbwa kwenu kushoma. Chokomende ndinoti kwamuli, mungoba nokudimbwa kunanga semhuji yemasitadi, mungati kudunhu yeli, ‘Ibhuda yopa, unde yokuya,’ linova lyenda, apana chichamukona.” <verse eid="MAT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amwe makwalo echiGiliki aana indima yeyi</char></note>Koga unshobo yoyu autobhuda, kuzhe komunamato nokuzwiminya kulya.<verse eid="MAT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu unoleba akale nezwolufu nokumuka kukwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mako 9:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luka 9:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22" />Bekabungana muGalili, Jesu wakati kwabali, “Mwananhulumyana woNhu unoopilwa mumaboko abanhu, <verse eid="MAT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23" />akale banoombulaya, kova emuswa nezhuba lyatatu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:23">Ibo bakanyajikana nazwo.<verse eid="MAT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulipa uNtelo womuTempeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24" />Pabakaswika kuKapenaume, batelesi bomutelo wetempeli bakezha kunaPita, bakati, “Undayiji wenu unobhisa mutelo na”<verse eid="MAT 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25" />Wakati, “Eya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:25">Paakezha kusha, Jesu ndiye wakatanga kulebeleka naye, eti “Umuyeyani, Simoni? Mashe enyika anolipisa aani untelo? Bana babo kana bamwe?”<verse eid="MAT 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26" />Akale paakati kuna iye, “Kunabamwe,”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:26">Jesu wakati kuna iye, “Nokudalo banabanhulumyana balosungunuka. <verse eid="MAT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27" />Nokudalo, kuti tisibanyemeje, inda kugungwa, upose kalozo, utole ihobe ichatanga kubhatwa, ungoyishamula undomo wayo unowana ikobeli lilokosha, ulitole ubape libe indipo yangu nawi.”<verse eid="MAT 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18" />
  <para style="s">Unkulwana Kasa Ndiani?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mako 9:33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luka 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1" />Nooyo unshaji balayijwa babe bakenda kuna Jesu, bakati, “Ndiyani unkulwana kasa mubushe bwedenga?”<verse eid="MAT 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2" />Iye wakashoba mwanantukutuku, akomisa pakati pabo, <verse eid="MAT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3" />akati, “Ndinolebesa nditi kunamwi, kuzhe kokuti mushanduke mube sabana batukutuku, amutoobungwina bushe bwedenga. <verse eid="MAT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4" />Yoyo unozwininipisa somwana yoyu, ndiye unkulwana kasa mubushe bwedenga. <verse eid="MAT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5" />Aanizwe unotambula mwana unanga soyu muzina lyangu, unooba atambula imi.”<verse eid="MAT 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukwejwa muluchinyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Mako 9:42-48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1">Luka 17:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 17:2">2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6" />“Asi yoyo unotisa kuti umwe wabatukutuku yaba banodimbwa kunami kuti bechinye, zwingaba zwibuyanana kuna iye kuti igwiyo igulwana lisungililwe munchibha uwe, eposelwe pasi mugungwa. <verse eid="MAT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7" />Lutaka kunyika pezhulu polukwejo lokuchinya! Nokuti zwinokwelela kuti lukwejo luzhe, koga lutaka kunoyo unhu, unobuza lukwejo!”<verse eid="MAT 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8" />“Luboko lulwo kana igumbo lilyo zwikungwinisa muluchinyo, dumula ulashe, zwibuyanana kwauli kuti ungwine kubupenyu ulichilema kana kuti uligosha, pana kuti ulashilwe mumoto usinopela ulinamaboko mabili kana makumbo mabili. <verse eid="MAT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9" />Kana izhisho lilyo likungwinisa muluchinyo, libhise ulilashe, zwibuyanana kwauli kuti ungwine kubupenyu uli nezhisho limwempela chete, pana kuti uposelwe mumoto wegehena ulinamesho mabili.”<verse eid="MAT 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unkwejaniso weMhwizi yakaLashika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Luka 15:3-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10" />Lingani kuti musilingilepasi umwe wabatukutuku yaba, nokuti ndinoti kwamuli, ingilozi jabo jikwo kudenga jinogala jibona chiso chaTate Bangu baiko kudenga. <verse eid="MAT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amwe makwalo aana indima yeyi</char></note>Nokuti Mwananhulumyana woNhu wakezha koochija balolashika.<verse eid="MAT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12" />“Motini imwi? Kana unhu eli nemhwizi izana, kova imwe yajo ilashika, aatosiya na jili makumi mashanu ana makumi mana neshanu nena jimo mumatunhu, enda kunopyanga yendiya yakalashika? <verse eid="MAT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13" />Kana akayiwana, chokomende, ndinoti kwamuli, unoshantilwa nayo kasa kupinda yeji makumi mashanu ana mana neshanu jinena jisakabalashika. <verse eid="MAT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14" />Nokudalo akutoba kuda kwaTate Bangu baiko kudenga kuti umwe wabatukutuku yaba epalale.”<verse eid="MAT 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umwe angokuchinyila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15" />“Kana mwanakwaina uwo akuchinyila, inda unombuja paaleswa. Angokuwhilila, unobawana mwanakwaina uwo. <verse eid="MAT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16" />Koga kana esinokuwhilila, tola umwe kana babili, bende nawi kuti zwilebo zwose zwisimatijwe nabanhu babili kana batatu sabasumikiji. <verse eid="MAT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17" />Kana angolamba kubawhilila, ibuja beGubungano, angolamba kuwhilila beGubungano, untoleni sonhu wamusinani naye unanga sowokuzhe kana untelesi.<verse eid="MAT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kujibisa nokuvumija</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18" />“Chokomende ndinoti kwamuli, Chose chamuchasunga pasi yopano, nokudenga chinooba chasungwa, nezwo zwamuchasungunula pasi yopano, nokudenga zwinooba zwasungunulwa neebo.”<verse eid="MAT 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19" />“Akale ndinoti kwamuli, kana babili bavumilana pasi yopano panachipi chabanokumbila, banoozwitilwa naTate Bangu baiko kudenga. <verse eid="MAT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20" />Nokuti panababili kana batatu bakabungana muzina lyangu, nami ndipo pakati pabo.”<verse eid="MAT 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unkwejaniso Wonshingi Usina Ishe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21" />Pakalepo Pita wakoondila, akati kwaali, “Tezi, ndondekejela kujine kube lini mwanakwaina wangu unondichinyila? Biya ndundekejele kujine kube tushanu tuna tubili na?”<verse eid="MAT 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22" />Jesu wakati kunaiye, “Andijikumuti kunawi, tushanu tuna tubili, koga makumi mashanu ana makumi mabili anokwilikanywa tushanu tuna tubili. <verse eid="MAT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23" />Nokudalo bushe bwedenga bungakwejaniswa sashe wakabeda kuziba kuti bashingi babe bakaba belina imalini iye. <verse eid="MAT 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24" />Wakati atanga kubala imali jije, umwe wakabuzwa kunaiye wakabeli nechikwelete chikulwana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Italenta lyakaba lili indalama inobulemu bwe 30kg </char></note>chezwiulu nezwiulu zwemali. <verse eid="MAT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25" />Nokuti wakaba esina imali yokulipa, nokudalo tezi uwe wakaleba kuti iye, unkaji uwe, bana babe bose, naizwo zwose zwaananazo zwitengeswe kutila kuti elipe chikwelete. <verse eid="MAT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26" />Unshingi wakawila pasi nezwivi akabweta eti, ‘Tezi nditileni moyo undefu nche, ndomulipa zwose.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27" />Neshe, tezi bonshingi bakonsupula, bakondekejela chikwelete chiche.”<verse eid="MAT 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28" />“Koga unshingi wakaleyondiya wakati abhuda yopo, wakashangana noumwe unshingikwaina, wakabeli nechikwelete chiche chitukutuku chemali yamakobeli izana <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Idinali lyakabekwelana nendipo yoshinga izhuba limwempela. </char></note>yamadinali. Wankosina kangoto, eti, ‘Ndipe mali yangu!’ <verse eid="MAT 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29" />Koga unshingikwaina uwe wakawila pasi, eti, ‘Ndakubweta, iba nomwoyo undefu nami, ndichamulipa.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30" />Wakalamba, akanoumbiga muntolongo kuswikila alipa chikwelete chiche. <verse eid="MAT 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31" />Bamwe bashingikwaina pabakabona zwaluba zwatikana, zwakabalwaja kasa, bakanobuja tezi wabo zwose zwakabatikana. <verse eid="MAT 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32" />Kova tezi onshoba, akati kwaali, ‘Iwi nshingi unamwoyo umbi! ndakakulekejela chikwelete chose nokuti wakandibweta, <verse eid="MAT 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33" />Aujakabekwelela, na kuti iwi utilebo unshingikwaina uwo ishe, sezwindakata pandakakutilabo ishe?’ <verse eid="MAT 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34" />Mukulutila kasa tezi, wakompila mumaboko abashingi bomutolongo kuti boyangatise kuswikila alipa chikwelete chose.<verse eid="MAT 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35" />“Neebo Tate Bangu bokudenga, banoomuta alo mose, umwe noumwe, kana musinolekejela banakwaina benu nemyoyo yenu.”<verse eid="MAT 18:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19" />
  <para style="s">Jesu UnoLayija Nezwokusokushimana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Mako 10:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1" />Ngweno Jesu paakapeja indebo yeji, wakabhuda munyika yeGalili akenda munyika yeJudiya, museli molwizi lweJolodani, <verse eid="MAT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2" />mabunga makulwana akoontobela, akale akabachilisa kwakale.<verse eid="MAT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3" />Akale bamwe baFalisi bakezha kwaali bonkweja, bebhuza beti, “Zwipo pamulawo na, kuti unhulume eshime unkaji uwe pechisoko kana chipi?”<verse eid="MAT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4" />Wakabashandula eti, “Amujakabala na kuti Iye wakababumba kuvila pakutanga wakata unhulume nonhukaji, <verse eid="MAT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5" />akale akati, ‘Nechisoko yechi unhulume unoosiya tate namai babe, unoobhatana nonkaji uwe, akale yabababili bachaba umbili umwempela?’ <verse eid="MAT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6" />Nezwo abachibabili koga umbili umwempela. Nokudalo yezwo zwashanganiswa naMwali, kusibe nonhu uchapambulanya.”<verse eid="MAT 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7" />Bakati kwaali, “Ini biya Mozesi akalaya kuti epiwe lukwalo lwokuunshima, kuti ende?”<verse eid="MAT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8" />Wakati kwabali, “Nokukoma kwemyoyo yenu, Mozesi wakavumila kuti mushime bakaji benu, koga kuvila pakutanga azwijakabeli alo. <verse eid="MAT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9" />Akale imi ndoti kwamuli, yoyo unoshima unkaji uwe, kuzhe kobupombwe, kova elobola umwe, unoba epombola.”<verse eid="MAT 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10" />Balayijwa babe bakati kwaali, “Kana yakadalo inyaya yonhulume nonkaji uwe, azwitoba zwibuya kulobola.”<verse eid="MAT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11" />Koga wakati kwabali, “Abatoba bose banhu bangatambula indebo yeyi, asi yabo bakazwipiwa. <verse eid="MAT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12" />Nokudalo baipo insunyulwi kuvila pakuzwalwa, akale baipo bakatiwa insunyulwi nabanhu, akale pana bakazwita insunyulwi, betila bushe bokudenga. Yoyo unotubula kutambula indayijo yeyi, ngeetambule.”<verse eid="MAT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu unoKombolela Bana Batukutuku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mako 10:13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luka 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13" />Kova bana bebuzwa kwaali kuti ebabige maboko ebanamatile. Balayijwa babe bakakalalila banhu bakabuza bana, <verse eid="MAT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14" />asi Jesu wakati, “Ilekejani bana bezhe kwandili, musibajibise, nokuti bushe bwedenga ngobwabakadai.”<verse eid="MAT 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15" />Akababiga maboko pabali, akale akenda.<verse eid="MAT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unzhuzha uLofuma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mako 10:17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luka 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16" />Akale ilingani, umwe wakezha kwaali eti, “Ndayiji, ngechipi chito chibuyanana chandingate kuti ndiwane bupenyu businopela?”<verse eid="MAT 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17" />Wakati kwaali, “Ini undibhuza nezwibuya? Umwempela chete umbuya. Koga kana uda kungwina mubupenyu businopela, ilondota milawo.”<verse eid="MAT 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18" />Wakombhuza eti, “Ipi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 19:18">Jesu wakashandula eti, “usibulaye, usipombole, usikwibe, usipe busumikiji boniepa, <verse eid="MAT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19" />lemekeja tate babo namai babo, akale ude umbakijani uwo sezwaunozwida iwi.”<verse eid="MAT 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20" />Unzhuzha wakati kwaali, “Yezwi zwose ndakazwitobeleja, ngezwipi zwandichinotaija?”<verse eid="MAT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21" />Jesu wakati kwaali, “Kana uda kupelelela, inda, unotengesa zwose zwauna nazwo akale upe basheti, unoba nefuma kudenga, uzhe, unditobele.”<verse eid="MAT 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22" />Unzhuzha paakawha yezwi wakabhuda yopo akahetela, nokuti wakaba akafuma kasakasa.<verse eid="MAT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23" />Jesu wakati kubalayijwa babe, “Chokomende ndinoti kwamuli, zwikukutu kuti unhu wakafuma engwine mubushe bokudenga. <verse eid="MAT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24" />Akale ndinomubuja, kuti zwilelu kuti ikamela ingwine mukabanga keneleti, kupinda kuti umfumi engwine mubushe bwaMwali.”<verse eid="MAT 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25" />Balayijwa pabakawha yezwi bakachenama kasa beti, “Ani biya angachijwa ndiani?”<verse eid="MAT 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26" />Koga Jesu wakabalinga akati, “Kubanhu azwitotubulika, asi naMwali, zwose zwinhu zwinotubulika.”<verse eid="MAT 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27" />Kova Pita eti, “isu takasiya zwose tikakutobela. Ini zwatichawana?”<verse eid="MAT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28" />Jesu wakati kwabali, “Chokomende ndinoti kwamuli, munyika ipya, yopo Mwananhulumyana woNhu paachogala pechigalo chinongaima chobushe bubwe, namwibo bakanditobela munoogala pezwigalo zwobushe zwili gumi nezwibili, munoopa untongo kunduji jabaIzilayeli jiligumi nembili. <verse eid="MAT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29" />Akale banhu bose bakasiya ingumba, kana bakazwaji bechinhulume, kana bakazwaji bechinhukaji, kana tate, kana amai, kana bana, kana minda pezhulu pezina lyangu banootambuliswa zwilokwilikana izana, banongwina mushabo lyobupenyu businopela. <verse eid="MAT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30" />Koga banji bokutanga banooba bokupejisila, akale bokupejisila banooba bokutanga.”<verse eid="MAT 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20" />
  <para style="s">Bashingi Muminda Wonzhambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1" />“Bushe bwedenga bunokwejaniswa nomweni wominda wakabhuda zhingwanangwana kunopyanga bashingi kuti bende kuminda uwe wonzhambi. <verse eid="MAT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2" />Paakati avumilana nabashingi kuti unobalipa idinali pezhuba, wakabasenga kuminda uwe wonzhambi. <verse eid="MAT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3" />Wakabhuda kabili zhingwanangwana nonshaji weshanu notuna akenda pamusika, akanowana bamwe belimile pesina zwabanota, <verse eid="MAT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4" />wakati kuna ibo, ‘Namwibo indani kuminda wangu wonzhambi ndomupa indipo ilokwelela.’ Akale bakenda. <verse eid="MAT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5" />Wakenda akale masikati nonshaji wegumi linatubili, wakata alo akale masikatideko nonshaji wegumi notushanu. <verse eid="MAT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6" />Madekwana nonshaji wegumi linatushanu tunatubili, wakabhuda akawana bamwe belimile pesina zwabanota, wakababhuza eti, ‘Ini mulimile zwenu pesina zwamumuta izhuba lyose?’ <verse eid="MAT 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7" />Bakonshandula beti, ‘Apana unhu watipa unshingo.’ Akati kwabali, ‘Namwibo indani kuminda wangu wonzhambi.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8" />“Pakwakati kwaswibha, mweni wominda wonzhambi wakati kuntungamili uwe, ‘Ishoba bashingi ubape indipilo yabo, utange nabomushule upejeleje nabokutanga.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9" />Bakatangisa unshingo madekwana nonshaji wegumi linatushanu notubili, pabakaswika, bakapiwa umwe noumwe idinali. <verse eid="MAT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10" />Pakwakezha bokutanga, bakayeya kuti banopiwa inji, koga bakapiwa bo indipilo yedinali umwe noumwe. <verse eid="MAT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11" />Pakutambula, bakanyunyuta kumweni wominda, <verse eid="MAT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12" />beti, ‘Yaba bopejeleja bashinga iawa limwempela, koga mwabapa indipilo ilokwelana neyedu, isu tata unshingo unji wezhuba lyose tikapiswa kasa nezhuba.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13" />Iye wakashandula kumwe wabo eti, ‘Nkwaina, andijakubipisila, aujavumilana nami idinali na?’ <verse eid="MAT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14" />Tola chicho, unde azwo. Kuda kwangu kupa womushule zwilokwelana nezwandakupa iwi. <verse eid="MAT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15" />Anditovumilwa na kuta madilo pezhulu pemali yangu na? Kana unefupa nomwoyo wangu umbuya?”<verse eid="MAT 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16" />“Nokudalo bopejeleja banooba bokutanga, nabokutanga banooba bokupejeleja.”<verse eid="MAT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Unolebeleka Kwechitatu Pezhulu Polufu Lulwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mako 10:32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luka 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17" />Paakati Jesu etanhisa enda kuJelusalema, wakatola balayijwa babe igumi nababili beli boga, beli munzila wakati kwabali, <verse eid="MAT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18" />“Bonani, tikumutanhisa tinda kuJelusalema, Mwananhulumyana woNhu uchanopilwa kubatebuji bakulwana nokubakwali bomulawo, ibo banontongela lufu, <verse eid="MAT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19" />banompila kubanhu bokuzhe kuti boheule, bonabhe, bonkahamile, koga unoomuswa nezhuba lyatatu.”<verse eid="MAT 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chikumbilo Chamai KunaJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Mako 10:35-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20" />Ndipo pakezha amai babana banhulumyana baZebhedi kwaali nabana banhulumyana babo bakomfhugamila beda kuswincha chikumbilo chabo kwaali.<verse eid="MAT 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21" />Wakati kwabali, “Ani imwi munodani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:21">Ibo bakati kwaali, “vumila kuti bana banhulumyana bangu yaba babili begale nawi, umwe kululyi umwe kuchesho chicho mubushe bubo.”<verse eid="MAT 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22" />Koga Jesu wakashandula eti, “Amutoziba chamukumukumbila. Munotubula kunwa unkombe wandichanwa na?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:22">Bakati kuna iye, “Totubula.”<verse eid="MAT 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23" />Wakati kwabali, “Muchanwa unkombe wangu, koga kugala kululyi kana kuchesho kwangu atoba imi ndinopa, nokuti bugalo yobu ngobwaabo bakabulonganyilwa naTate bangu.”<verse eid="MAT 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24" />Pabakati bazwiwha baligumi, bakabanyemela unkulu nonuna. <verse eid="MAT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25" />Koga Jesu wakabashobela kwaali akati, “Munoziba kuti batongi baBokuzhe banobatonga nobukukutu, nabakulwana babo banoshingisa masimba pezhulu pabo. <verse eid="MAT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26" />Akujilokwelela kuba alo pakati penu, koga yoyo unoda kuba unkulwana pakati penu, ngeebe unshingi wenu, <verse eid="MAT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27" />yoyo unoda kuba wokutanga, mukati mwenu, ngeebe undanda wenu, <verse eid="MAT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28" />sezwakata Mwananhulumyana woNhu, aajakezha koshingilwa iye, asi kuti eshingile bamwe, nokupa bupenyu bubwe kuti bube indipilo yokuchija banji.”<verse eid="MAT 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Unochilisa Mapofu Mabili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mako 10:46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luka 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29" />Jesu nabalayijwa babe pabakati bebhuda muJeliko, ibunga lyabanhu igulwana lyakontobela. <verse eid="MAT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30" />Mapofu mabili aluba eligele kumbali kwenzila, bakati bawha kuti Jesu ukumupinda, bakashomeja beti, “Tezi, Mwananhulumyana waDavidi, tiwhile ishe!”<verse eid="MAT 20:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31" />Ibunga lyabanhu lyakabakalalila, kuti bewhilijile koga ibo bakanyanya kushomeja beti, “Tezi Mwananhulumyana waDavidi, tiwhilebo ishe!”<verse eid="MAT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32" />Jesu wakama akabashoba, eti, “Munoda kuti ndimutileni?”<verse eid="MAT 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33" />Ibo bakati kwaali, “Tezi, ita kuti mesho edu ebone!”<verse eid="MAT 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34" />Jesu wakabawhila ishe, akaguma mesho abo, ibo bakava babona pakalepo, bakontobela.<verse eid="MAT 20:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21" />
  <para style="s">Kungwina kokuzunda muJelusalema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mako 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Joni 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1" />Pabakati baba pelyo neJelusalema, akale bakaswika kuguta lyeBhetifaji, lipo pedunhu lyamaOlivi, pakalepo Jesu wakatuma balayijwa babili, <verse eid="MAT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2" />eti kwabali, “Indani munsha ulolingana namwi, mowana idonki lilosungililwa, lili nomwana walyo, muasupule, muabuze kwandili. <verse eid="MAT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3" />Kana pelina uchalebeleka namwi chimwe chinhu, moti, ‘She unoada,’ akale iye unoatumija pakalepo.”<verse eid="MAT 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4" />Yechi chakatikana kuti kuzhajikijwe zwakalebwa nompolofeti, eti,<verse eid="MAT 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5" />“Ibuja, mwananhukajana weZiyoni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">Ilinga, She uwo ukumuzha kwauli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">Akazwininipisa, ekatanha idonki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">eli pezhulu pomwana wedonki.”<verse eid="MAT 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6" />Balayijwa bakenda akale bakanota sokulaywa kwabo naJesu, <verse eid="MAT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7" />bakabuza idonki nomwana walyo, akale bakawala ishashiko jabo pezhulu pawo, akagala pezhulu pajo. <verse eid="MAT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8" />Bunji bwebunga bwakawala ishashiko jabo mungwagwa, bamwe bakatema inhabi jemiti bakawala mungwagwa beuntambula. <verse eid="MAT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9" />Akale ibunga lyakabekwenda lili mbeli kukwe nelyakabeli mushule lilye bakabeshomeja, beti, “Hosana kuMwananhulumyana waDavidi! Ulokombolelwa iye unozha muzina lyaTezi! Hosana upezhuluzhulu!”<verse eid="MAT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10" />Akale paakangwina muguta igulwana lyeJelusalema, kwakaba nokukovongeka, beti, “Ndiani yoyu”<verse eid="MAT 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11" />Ibunga lyakashandula liti, “Yoyu ndiJesu umpolofeti unova kuguta lyeNazaleta yokuGalili.”<verse eid="MAT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu unonda kuTempeli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mako 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luka 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Joni 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12" />Akale Jesu wakangwina mutempeli, akabatata bose bashambaji nabatengi mutempeli, akale akapindimula zwitala zwabatengesi bemali, nezwibhula zwaabo bakabeshambaja inkwilimba. <verse eid="MAT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13" />Wakati kwabali, “Zwilokwalwa kuwhi, ‘Ingumba yangu inooshobwa kuwhi ingumba yokunamata, koga imwi mumuita chifuko chabapambi.”<verse eid="MAT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14" />Mapofu namakosha bakezha kwaali mutempeli, akabachilisa. <verse eid="MAT 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15" />Koga batebuji bakulwana nabakwali bomulawo, pabakabona zwinhu zwinoshamisa zwaakabeta, akale nabana beshomeja mutempeli beti, “Hosana kuMwananhulumyana waDavidi!” Bakabipilwa, <verse eid="MAT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16" />bakati kwaali, “Uzwiwhile na zwibamuleba nabana yaba?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:16">Jesu wakati kwabali, “Eya, amujanu mwabala na kuti, ‘Mumilomo yabana batukutuku nabacheche mwakabhisa lukujo lulopelela?”<verse eid="MAT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17" />Akale paakabasiya, wakabhuda muguta igulwana, akenda kuguta lyeBhetani ndiko kwaakanolala.<verse eid="MAT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Unofhizha Unkuyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Mako 11:12-14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 11:20-24">20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18" />Zhingwanangwana, ebwilila kuguta igulwana, wakawha zhala. <verse eid="MAT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19" />Akale paakabona unkuyu wakabeli pelyo nenzila, wakenda kwauli koga aajakawana chinhu, kuzhe kwamazhani chete. Wakati kwauli, “Usizwale unchelo akale!” Unkuyu wakahwihwinyala pakalepo.<verse eid="MAT 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20" />Bazwibona yezwi balayijwa bakachenama kasa, bakati, “Unkuyu wahwihwimala chini pakalepo?”<verse eid="MAT 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21" />Akale Jesu wakabashandula eti, “Chokomende, ndinoti kwamuli, kana mulinokudimbwa musinokahajika, moota zwinopinda zwandata pankuyu, munooti kudunhu yeli, ‘Nyukuka, uposelwe mugungwa, akale zwinootikana. <verse eid="MAT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22" />Neebo chose chamuchakumbila mukunamata mudimbwa, mochipiwa.<verse eid="MAT 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umbhuzo Pezhulu Pesimba lyaJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mako 11:27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luka 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23" />Jesu paakangwina mutempeli, batebuji bakulwana nabatungamili babanhu bakonzhila elikumulayija, bakati, “Yezwi zwawumuta umuzwita nesimba lipi, akale ndiani wakakupa isimba yeli?”<verse eid="MAT 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24" />Jesu wakabashandula, eti, “Namibo ndomubhuza umbhuzo mungondishandula, namibo ndomubuja kuti yezwi ndimuzwita nesimba lyani. <verse eid="MAT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25" />Umbhabhatizo waJoni wakava kupi? Wakava kudenga kana wakava kubanhu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:25">Bakakakabajana boga boga, beti, “Tingoti, ‘kudenga, unoti kwatili, ‘Mwakalekelani kudimbwa kwaali?’ <verse eid="MAT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26" />Koga tingoti, kubanhu, totya ibunga lyabanhu, nokuti bose banoti Joni wakabeli umpolofeti.” <verse eid="MAT 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27" />Sezwo bakonshandula Jesu beti, “Atitoziba.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:27">Akale iye wakati kwabali, “Neebo anditomubuja kuti yezwi zwinhu ndozwita nesimba lipi.”<verse eid="MAT 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unkwejaniso Wabanabanhulumyana Babili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28" />“Moyeyani? Unhulume waluba nabana banhulumyana babili, wakenda kuna wokutanga akati, ‘Mwananhulumyana wangu, inda unoshinga muminda wonzhambi nasi.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29" />Wakashandula eti, ‘Anditonda,’ koga mushule wakazwifija akenda. <verse eid="MAT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30" />Akale akenda kunowabili, akaleba zwimwempela. Akale mwananhulumyana wakashandula, eti, Ndonda, Tezi,’ asi aajakenda. <verse eid="MAT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31" />Pabubili bwabo ndiani wakata kuda kwatate babe”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Bakati kwaali, “Wotanga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Jesu akati kwabali, “Chokomende ndoti kwamuli, batelesi namavemu bakumumutangijila kungwina mubushe bwaMwali. <verse eid="MAT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32" />Joni wakezha kunamwi munzila yobululami, amujakadimbwa kwaali, koga batelesi namavemu bakadimbwa kwaali, akale kojoba mwakazwibona yezwi, azwijakamuta kuti mushanduke mudimbwe kuna iye.”<verse eid="MAT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unkwejaniso Wabalochenekeswa muMinda wonzhambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mako 12:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luka 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33" />“Iwhani umwe unkwejaniso. Pakabelina mweni wominda wakalima unda wonzhambi, akabyala mizhambi akashosha uminda wose, akacha idizwa lyokuswinila, akabaka bushozhi, akachenekesa bamwe balimi, iye akenda kuna imwe inyika. <verse eid="MAT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34" />Unshaji wokuvuna wasendela, wakatuma bashingi babe kubalimi kunotola unchelo uwe, <verse eid="MAT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35" />balimi bakabhata bashingi babe, umwe bakondoba, umwe bakombulaya, akale umwe bakompubula namabwe. <verse eid="MAT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36" />Akale wakatuma bamwe bashingi, banji kupinda bokutanga, akale bakatiwa zwimwempela. <verse eid="MAT 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37" />Mushule mezwi wakatuma mwananhulumyana uwe kunaibo eti, ‘Banondemekeja mwananhulumyana wangu.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38" />Koga, bachenekwi pabakombona mwananhulumyana, bakati belebeleka chabochabo, ‘Yoyu ndiye undyifuma, izhani tiumbulaye, titole ishabo yiye.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39" />Bakontola, bakonkuluntila kuzhe kominda wonzhambi, bakombulaya.”<verse eid="MAT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40" />“Paachabuya mweni wominda wonzhambi, unoobatani bachenekwi yabo”<verse eid="MAT 21:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41" />Batebuji bakulwana nabatungamili bakonshandula beti, “Unoobabulaya nenzila inolwaja banhu babi yabo, etikochenekesa unda wonzhambi kunabamwe bachenekwi bachompa michelo nomwaka wayo.”<verse eid="MAT 21:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42" />Jesu wakati kwabali, “Amujanu mwabala na mumakwalo machena kuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">“Ilyo ibhango lyakalambwa nababaki</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">Ndilyo lyaba imhandalukokola lwengumba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">Yezwi zwakatiwa naTezi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">Akale zwinochenamisa mumesho edu”<verse eid="MAT 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43" />“Nokudalo ndomubuja kuti, mootolelwa bushe bwaMwali, akale bunoopiwa luji luchoozwala michelo yayo. <verse eid="MAT 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44" />Akale iye unowila pezhulu peli ibwe unoovunauka ebe tupanzitupanzi, koga lingowila pezhulu ponhu linoompwanyaula.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jimwe iwhalo jechiGiliki jantolo ajina indima yeyi</char></note><verse eid="MAT 21:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45" />Batebuji bakulwana nabaFalisi pabakawha mikwejaniso yiye, bakaziba kuti ukumuleba ibo. <verse eid="MAT 21:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46" />Koga pabakakweja kuti bonsunge, bakatya mabunga abanhu, nokuti bakabontola sompolofeti.<verse eid="MAT 21:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22" />
  <para style="s">Unkwejaniso waMabhiko oKulobolana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Luka 14:15-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1" />Akale Jesu wakalebeleka nabo nemikwejaniso, eti, <verse eid="MAT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2" />“Bushe bwokudenga bungakwejaniswa naTezi, wakalonganyila mwananhulumyana uwe mabhiko okulobolana. <verse eid="MAT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3" />Wakatuma bashingi babe kunoshoba yabo bakabakakokwa kumabhiko okulobolana, koga ibo abajakezha. <verse eid="MAT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4" />Wakatuma kabili bamwe bashingi, eti, ‘Bujani bakakokwa kuti ndalonganya kale chilayilo changu, inkabe namanamani alokola abulayiwa, zwose zwalonganywa izhani kumabhiko okulobolana.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5" />Koga abajakazwiwhilila, wokutanga wakenda kuminda uwe, umwe wakenda kunshingo uwe. <verse eid="MAT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6" />Bamwe ndibo bakabhata bashingi babe, bakaba shunguluja, nokubabulaya. <verse eid="MAT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7" />She wakanyema, akatuma balwi babe kuti benopalaja babulayi yabo, nokupisa iguta igulwana lyabo. <verse eid="MAT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8" />Wakati kubashingi babe, ‘mabhiko alonganywa, koga bakabakokwa abajakabekwelela. <verse eid="MAT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9" />Nokudalo indani panoshangana jinzila, mukoke banhu banji bamuchawana kuti bezhe kumabhiko okulobolana.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10" />Bashingi yaba bakabhuda, bakenda kumigwagwa, bakanoshoba bose babakabona, babi nababuya, ingumba yamabhiko yakava yazhala nabakokwi.”<verse eid="MAT 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11" />“She paakangwina kuti ebone baluba bakakokwa, wakabona umwe unhu usakabakambala chimbalo chamabhiko okulobolana, <verse eid="MAT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12" />wakati kwaali, ‘nkwaina, ani biya wangwina chini yomuno usina chimbalo chamabhiko okulobolana?’ Koga iye wakapelelwa namawhi. <verse eid="MAT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13" />She wakati kubashingi, ‘Unsungeni makumbo namaboko, muumposele munhilima yopazhe, yomo banhu banooba nokulila nokuziyanisa meno.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14" />“Nokuti balokokwa banji, koga banoshalwa bashoma.”<verse eid="MAT 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umbuzo wokulipa Untelo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mako 12:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luka 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15" />BaFalisi bakenda, bakanolangana kuti bangonteya chini mukulebeleka kukwe. <verse eid="MAT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16" />Bakatumila kwaali balayijwa babo nabamwe bebhazu lyaHelodi, beti, “Ndayiji, tinoziba kuti ndiwi unoleba ichokomende, akale unolayija inzila yaMwali nechokomende, aunani kuti banhu banotini akale aunani nezwaali unhu. <verse eid="MAT 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17" />Nokudalo tibuje kuti umuyeyani. Zwimomumulawo kulipa untelo kunaKesali kana ne?”<verse eid="MAT 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18" />Koga Jesu eziba bubi bwabo, wakati, “imwi bachengeji, ini mundikweja? <verse eid="MAT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19" />Nditondejeni ikobeli lyontelo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:19">Ibo bakontambika ikobeli. <verse eid="MAT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20" />Jesu wakati kwabali, “Untojaniso wani yoyu, akale izina lyani lipo yopa?”<verse eid="MAT 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21" />Bakati, “Ngezwa Kesali.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:21">Iye akati kwabali, “Nokudalo ipani Kesali zwaKesali, mupe Mwali zwaMwali.”<verse eid="MAT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22" />Pabakawha yezwi bakachenama, bakonsiya, bakenda.<verse eid="MAT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umbhuzo pezhulu pokumuka kwabakafa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mako 12:18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luka 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23" />Nelyakalelo izhuba baSadusi yabo banoti akuna kumuka kubafi, bakezha kuna iye, bakombhuza, <verse eid="MAT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24" />beti, “Ndayiji, Mozesi wakati, ‘Kana unhulume angofa esina bana, ununa uwe ulokwelela kungwina inchilikaji, kuti ezwalile unkulu uwe bana.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25" />Ngweno kwaluba unkulu wakabeli nabanuna babe bashanu nomwempela pakati pedu, unkulu wakalobola, akoofa, ajakasiya mwana, unkaji uwe wakongwinwa nonuna. <verse eid="MAT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26" />Zwakatikana kuna wechibili, nowechitatu, kuswikila kuna wobushanu tuna tubili. <verse eid="MAT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27" />Mushule mwabo bose unhukaji wakafa. <verse eid="MAT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28" />Mukumuka kwabakafa, unooba unkaji wani pabashanu nababili yaba? Nokuti bose bakabondobola.”<verse eid="MAT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29" />Jesu wakabashandula eti, “Mwaleswa pezhulu pokusoziba makwalo nesimba lyaMwali wenu. <verse eid="MAT 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30" />Nokuti mukumuka kwabakafa akuna kulobola kana kulobolwa, koga banooba sengilozi kudenga. <verse eid="MAT 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31" />Panezwokumuka kuna bakafa, amujakabala na zwakalebwa naMwali kwamuli, <verse eid="MAT 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32" />‘Ndimi Mwali waAbhulahamu, naMwali waIsaki, naMwali waJakobe?’ Atoba Mwali wabakafa, koga ngowabapenyu.”<verse eid="MAT 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33" />Palyakati ibunga lyabanhu lyazwiwha, lyakachenamiswa nokulayija kukwe.<verse eid="MAT 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulawo Unkulugulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Mako 12:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luka 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34" />Koga baFalisi pabakawha kuti wakabazunda nendebo baSadusi, bakabungana. <verse eid="MAT 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35" />Umwe wabo wakaba eli mhizha yomulawo, wakabhuza onkweja, eti, <verse eid="MAT 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36" />“Ndayiji, ngoupi mulawo unkulwana mumilawo?”<verse eid="MAT 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37" />Iye wakati kwaali, “Ida Tezi Mwali uwo, nomwoyo uwo wose, nompepo uwo wose, nendangalilo iyo yose. <verse eid="MAT 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38" />Yoyu ndiwo mulawo unkulwana akale wotanga. <verse eid="MAT 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39" />Wabili unokwelana noyu, unoti, ‘Ida umbakijani uwo sobunozwida iwi.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40" />Pana yeyi milawo mibili ndipo pamile mulawo wose nendayijo jabapolofeti.”<verse eid="MAT 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umbhuzo pezhulu paMesiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mako 12:35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luka 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41" />Ngweno baFalisi bakashangana pamwempela, Jesu akabhuza umbuzo, <verse eid="MAT 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42" />eti, “Munotini nezwaKristo? Mwananhulumyana wani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:42">Bakati kwaali, “Mwananhulumyana waDavidi.”<verse eid="MAT 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43" />Wakati kwabali, “Ani ini iye Davidi etungamililwa noMpepo, unounshoba eti Tezi, elimukuti:<verse eid="MAT 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44" />Tezi wakati kunaTezi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">Gala kululyi lwangu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">kuswikila ndabiga babengi babo pasi pamakumbo awo”<verse eid="MAT 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45" />Kana Davidi ounshoba eti, ‘Tezi, angaba mwananhulumyana uwe chini?”<verse eid="MAT 22:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46" />Apana wakatubula kuunshandula, kuvila izhuba yelyo apana unhu wakanyengula kuumbhuza kabili.<verse eid="MAT 22:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23" />
  <para style="s">Jesu Umuchenjeja nezwaBakwali boMulawo nabaFalisi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:38">Mako 12:38</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 12:39">39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:43">Luka 11:43</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:46">46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45">20:45</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 20:46">46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1" />Pakalepo Jesu wakalebeleka kubunga lyabanhu nokubalayijwa babe, eti, <verse eid="MAT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2" />“Bakwali bomulawo nabaFalisi ndijo imhizha chomulawo waMozesi, <verse eid="MAT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3" />nokudalo itani nokulondota zwose zwabanomubuja, koga musite zwabanota, nokuti zwabanopupula abatozwita. <verse eid="MAT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4" />Banotola mitolo inolema beibiga pamapi abanhu, asi ibo besinoda kubabhancha kana nopatukutuku. <verse eid="MAT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5" />Banota mishingo yabo yose kuti bebonwe nabanhu, bekubusa tubhokesi tunamilawo tunombalwa pehuma nokulebhesa mayewula pezwimbalo zwabo. <verse eid="MAT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6" />Banoda kugala pezwigalo zwopezhuluzhulu kana beli kumabhiko nokugala pezwigalo zwinokujwa mumasinagogo, <verse eid="MAT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7" />nokumuswa nolukujo pamusika, nokushobwa nabanhu bewhi, ‘ndayiji.” <verse eid="MAT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8" />Asi imwi musishobwe kuwhi, ‘ndayiji’ nokuti muna undayiji umwempela chete, akale imwi mose mubanakwaina. <verse eid="MAT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9" />Musishobe umwe muti, ‘tate’ pasi yopano nokuti munaTate umwempela chete ukokudenga. <verse eid="MAT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10" />Akale musishobwe kuwhi, ‘ntungamili’ nokuti untungamili wenu umwempela chete, Kristo. <verse eid="MAT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11" />Yoyo unkulwana pakati penu ngeebe unshingi wenu. <verse eid="MAT 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12" />Yoyo unozwikuja unooninipiswa, koga yoyo unozwininipisa ndiye uchookujwa.”<verse eid="MAT 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Unolasha Buchengeji bwabo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:40">Mako 12:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:39-42">Luka 11:39-42</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:44">44</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:52">52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:47">20:47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13" />Lutaka kunamwi bakwali bomulawo nabaFalisi, bachengeji! Nokuti munokonyela banhu bushe bwedenga, imwi musinongwina nokwenu, akale musinovumila bamukweja kungwina kuti bengwine. <verse eid="MAT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14" />Lutaka, kunamwi bakwali nabaFalisi, bachengeji! Nokuti munotola ifuma yenchilikaji, muchengeja neminamato milefu, nezwo munoopiwa chilango chikulugulu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jimwe Iwhalo JechiGiliki jantolo ajina iwhalo yeyi</char></note><verse eid="MAT 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15" />“Lutaka kunamwi bakwali nabaFalisi, bachengeji! Nokuti munokwenda mugungwa nomunyika kuti mushandule umwempela wabokuzhe kuti kana aba alo, muunte ebe mwana wegehena zwilopamwa kabili kupinda imwi.”<verse eid="MAT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16" />“Lutaka kunamwi, batungamili mapofu, banoti ‘Kana unhu ekowha netempeli, azwineni, koga angokowha nendalama yomutempeli unosungwa nekowhe iye.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17" />Imwi mapofu malema! Chikulwana ngechipi, indalama kana itempeli linochenesa indalama? <verse eid="MAT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18" />Munoti, ‘Kana unhu ekowha nedebulilo azwineni, asi kana ekowha nontebulo wipo pedebulilo unosungwa nekowhe iye.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19" />Imwi mapofu! Chikulwana chipo ngechipi untebulo kana idebulilo linochenesa untebulo? <verse eid="MAT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20" />Nokudalo yoyo unokowha nedebulilo ukumukowha nalyo nezwose zwipo pezhulu palyo, <verse eid="MAT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21" />nooyo unokowha neTempeli wakowha nalyo, naMwali unogala mukati. <verse eid="MAT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22" />Nooyo unokowha nedenga, unokowha nechibhula chobushe bwaMwali, naMwali unogala pachili.”<verse eid="MAT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23" />“Lutaka kunamwi bakwali bomulawo nabaFalisi, bachengeji! Nokuti munobhisa chegumi chobutwilo bwamazhani bweminti, nedili nekumini, musiya zwinhu zwikulwana zwomulawo sendulamo, ishe nokubimbika, yezwi mulokwelela kuzwita musinosiyija zwimwe zwinokosha. <verse eid="MAT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24" />Imwi batungamili mapofu, munosefa tupuka tutukutuku tunangenhunzi koga muminya imhuka ihulwana sekamela.”<verse eid="MAT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25" />“Lutaka kunamwi bakwali bomulawo nabaFalisi, bachengeji! Nokuti munokusha pazhe ponkombe nendyilo koga mukati mulizhele bupambi nobupazwi. <verse eid="MAT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26" />Iwi Mfalisi bhofu! Kusha tangwa mukati mwonkombe nendyilo kuti pazhe pechenebo!<verse eid="MAT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27" />“Lutaka kunamwi bakwali bomulawo nabaFalisi, imwi bachengeji! Nokuti munanga samakumbu machena anoboneka eli mabhodo kuzhe, koga mukati elizhele namafupa abanhu bakafa, nobuhungu. <verse eid="MAT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28" />Ndizwo zwamuli imwi pazhe munobonekwa sabanhu bakalulama koga mukati mwenu muzhele buchengeji nobubi.”<verse eid="MAT 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Unolebambeli nokuLangwa Kwabo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:47-51">Luka 11:47-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29" />“Lutaka kunamwi bakwali bomulawo nabaFalisi, bachengeji! Nokuti munobaka makumbu abapolofeti nokunakisa makumbu abakalulama, <verse eid="MAT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30" />muti, ‘Ngana takabelipo unshaji yoyo wamatategulu edu, ngana tisakabhanchana nabo mukukutula ilopa lyabapolofeti.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31" />Nokudalo, seni munozwisumikijila nokwenu kuti ndimwi bana baabo bakabulaya bapolofeti. <verse eid="MAT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32" />Nezwo zhajikijani zwakasiyiwa namatategulu enu! <verse eid="MAT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33" />Imwi inyoka, inzwalo yemvumbi, mungatizha chini kuti mupiwe untongo wokuposelwa mugehena? <verse eid="MAT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34" />Nokudalo ndinomutumila bapolofeti, bachenjeli nabakwali bomulawo, bamwe babo munoobabulaya bamwe munoobakahamila panchinjikwa, bamwe munoobaloba mumasinagogo enu nokubashetesa mumakuta namakuta, <verse eid="MAT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35" />kutila kuti mutabukilwe nelopa lyose lyaabo bakalulama lyakakutukila penyika, kuvila kulopa lyaAbhelo ulolulama kuswikila kulopa lyaZakaliya mwana waBhalakiya, umwakabulayila pakati peTempeli nedebulilo. <verse eid="MAT 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36" />Chokomende ndinoti kwamuli, zwose zwinhu yezwi zwichezha pezhulu pechizekululu yechi.”<verse eid="MAT 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Unolwajilwa nezweJelusalema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:34">Luka 13:34</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 13:35">35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37" />“Lutaka, Jelusalema, Jelusalema iwi unobulaya bapolofeti, nokupubula yabo banotumwa kunawi! Tungana ndidisisa kubunganisa bana babo sehuku inofukatila bana bayo pasi pamapapilo ayo, koga wakalamba! <verse eid="MAT 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38" />Linga iTempeli lilyo lyasiyiwa akale lyabedongo. <verse eid="MAT 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39" />Nokuti ndinoti kwauli, auchinondibona kabili ujine uti, ‘Ulokombolelwa yoyu unozha muzina lyaTezi.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24" />
  <para style="s">Jesu Unolebeleka Nokupalajwa kweTempeli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:1">Mako 13:1</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 13:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5">Luka 21:5</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 21:6">6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1" />Jesu wakabhuda muTempeli, akakwenda eva peTempeli, bakezha balayijwa babe bakontondeja zwibakwa zwetempeli. <verse eid="MAT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2" />Koga wakabashandula eti, “Muzwibweni zwose yezwi na? Chokomende ndinoti kwamuli, apana ibwe kana limwempela lichoosala pezhulu pelimwe lisakakolomolwa.”<verse eid="MAT 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inyajo nenjabulo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mako 13:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luka 21:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3" />Eligele pasi Mudunhu lyeOlivi, balayijwa babe bakezha kwaali musiswa beti, “Tibuje, yezwi zwinootikana lini, akale chitondejelo chokuzha kuko ngechipi akale nechokupejeleja konshaji?” <verse eid="MAT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4" />Akale Jesu wakabashandula, eti, “Chenjelani kuti pesibe nouchamulasha. <verse eid="MAT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5" />Banji banoozha muzina lyangu beti, ‘Imi ndimi Kristo,’ banoolasha banji. <verse eid="MAT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6" />Moowha zwejihondo namalebwalebwa ejihondo, koga musitye, nokuti yezwi zwilokwelela kutikana, koga mapejelejo anoba asanu aswika. <verse eid="MAT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7" />Luji lunoomukila lumwe luji, bushe bunoomukila bumwe bushe, kunooba nebhamba akale nokuteketa kwenyika kubugalo bulosiyana siyana. <verse eid="MAT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8" />Zwose yezwi zwinanga samatangisilo okulwaja kwemimba.”<verse eid="MAT 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9" />“Pakalepo banomupila kuti muyabuliswe, bemubulaye akale moobengwa nenduji jenyika jose pezhulu pangu. <verse eid="MAT 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10" />Banji banoowa, akale banoochetana nokubengana. <verse eid="MAT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11" />Akale bapolofeti banji bamaniepwa banoobhuka akale banoolasha banji. <verse eid="MAT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12" />Nokuti bubi bunoowanda, ludo lwabanji lunooshomopala. <verse eid="MAT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13" />Koga yoyo uchasungwala kuswikila kumapejelejo, unoochijwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14" />Akale iNdebo iMbuya yeyi yobushe inoobhaunulwa kunyika jose, sobusumikiji kunduji jose, yopo ndipo pakuchaswika umpejelejo.”<verse eid="MAT 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chinhu Chinotyisa Kasakasa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Mako 13:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luka 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15" />“Sokudalo mungobona chinhu chineshambwa chinobuza kupalaja chakalebwa nompolofeti Daniyele, chilimile mubugalo buchena (unobala ngewhisise), <verse eid="MAT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16" />yabo baimo muJudiya ngebetizhile kumatunhu, <verse eid="MAT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17" />iye upo pezhulu pengumba esibhuluke kuti enotola zwinoba zwili mungumba yiye, <verse eid="MAT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18" />ukokuminda esibwilile kusha kunotola ishashiko yiye. <verse eid="MAT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19" />Lutaka, kuna yabo banemimba nabanomwisa mumazhuba yayo! <verse eid="MAT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20" />Namatani kuti kutizha kwenu kusibe nonshaji wemhepo kana nezhuba lyeSabata. <verse eid="MAT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21" />Noyo unshaji kunooba nenjabulo ihulwana zwisanu zwabaipo kuvila kumatangisilo enyika kuswikila ngweno, mane azwitobaipo akale. <verse eid="MAT 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22" />Akale ngana mazhuba yayo asakashomopajwa, akuna unhu umwempela waluchijwa, koga pezhulu paabo bakashalwa mazhuba yayo anooshomopajwa.”<verse eid="MAT 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23" />“Kojoba kana umwe angoti kwamuli, ‘Lingani, hoono Kristo!’ kana kuti, ‘Hondiya yokuya!’ Musizwidimbwe. <verse eid="MAT 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24" />Kunoozha baKristo bamaniepwa nabapolofeti bamaniepwa, bachoota zwitondejelo nezwishamiso zwikulwana, kutila kulasha, kana zwitubulika naabo bakashalwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25" />Iwhani, ndamubuja mbeli konshaji.”<verse eid="MAT 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26" />“Nezwo bangoti kwamuli, ‘ilingani umo mugwegulu,’ musinde, kana beti, ‘ilingani wimo mungumba jomukati musizwidimbwe. <verse eid="MAT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27" />Sezwinota lupalanganda, lunochenesa kubuvezhuba luswika kubumililo, kunooba alo pakuzha kwoMwananhulumyana woNhu.”<verse eid="MAT 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28" />“Pose pana chafa, panobungana magola.”<verse eid="MAT 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuzha kwoMwananhulumyana woNhu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mako 13:24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luka 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29" />“Pakalepo kuvila munjabulo jamazhuba yayo, izhuba linoojima, mweji autopenya, akale nenyenyeji jinoombwela jiva kudenga, akale namasimba amatenga anoozobanyiswa. <verse eid="MAT 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30" />Noyo unshaji kunooboneka chitondejelo choMwananhulumyana woNhu kudenga, nenduji jose jopasi jinoolila, jibona Mwananhulumyana woNhu ezha eli pamakole edenga, eli nesimba nokungaima kukulugulu, <verse eid="MAT 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31" />akale unootuma ingilozi jije jilija lukwembo lukulwana, jinoobunganisa bakashalwa babe kuva kumatibi mana enyika, beva kubhazu limwe lyedenga kunoswikila kunelimwe.”<verse eid="MAT 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chilayijo Chonti Wonkuyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mako 13:28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luka 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32" />“Iwanani indayijo kunkuyu, inhabi jingonyolopa akale pajinotanga kukwinila, munova mwaziba kuti izhizha lyaba pelyo. <verse eid="MAT 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33" />Nezwo, mungobona yezwi zwinhu zwose, zibani kuti wabapelyo, pankoba womene. <verse eid="MAT 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34" />Chokomende, ndinoti kwamuli, yechi chizekululu achitoopela zwisanu zwatikana zwose yezwi. <verse eid="MAT 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35" />Idenga nenyika zwinoopinda, koga mawhi angu aatoopinda.”<verse eid="MAT 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apana Unoziba Izhuba akale Nonshaji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Mako 13:32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Luka 17:26-30</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 17:34-36">34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36" />“Koga apana unoziba yelyo izhuba nooyo unshaji, kojoba ingilozi jedenga kana Mwananhulumyana, koga Tate chete. <verse eid="MAT 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37" />Somumazhuba aNowa, ndimo mukuchaba kuzha kwoMwananhulumyana woNhu. <verse eid="MAT 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38" />Somumazhuba yayo izhame lisanu lyaswika, bakabelya nokunwa, bakabelobola nokulobolwa, kuswikila izhuba lyaakangwina mubwato bukulwana Nowa, <verse eid="MAT 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39" />akale abajakaziba kuswikila izhame lyaswika, likabakukulula bose, ndimo mukuchaba pakuzha kwoMwananhulumyana woNhu. <verse eid="MAT 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40" />Pakalepo banhulume babili banoba belimuminda, umwe unotolwa akale umwe unosala. <verse eid="MAT 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41" />Banhukaji babili bekwiya pegwiyo, umwe unotolwa umwe unosala. <verse eid="MAT 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42" />Nokudalo ilindani, nokuti amutoziba kuti Tezi wenu unozha nelipi izhuba. <verse eid="MAT 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43" />Koga zibani yezwi, kuti ngana mweni wengumba akabeziba kuti imbava inozha nonshaji upi wobusiku, walulinda, aajaluleka imbava ingwina mungumba iye. <verse eid="MAT 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44" />Nokudalo imwi bo, galani mwakalonganya, nokuti Mwananhulumyana woNhu unoozha nonshaji wamusilolingilila.”<verse eid="MAT 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuba Unshingi Ulobimbika kana Unshingi Usilobimbika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">Luka 12:41-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45" />“Ndiani biya unshingi ulobimbika akale eli unchenjevu, wakapiwa unshingo wokulondota bashingi, kuti ebape zwokulya zwakakwelela kunabamwe bashingi nonshaji ulokwelela? <verse eid="MAT 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46" />Ulokombolelwa unshingi yoyo unoti kana tezi eswika ongwane eta sokubujwa kukwe. <verse eid="MAT 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47" />Chokomende ndinoti kwamuli, unoonta umbhati wefuma iye yose. <verse eid="MAT 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48" />Koga kana yoyo unshingi umbi angoti nechomumoyo uwe, “Tezi wangu wajilwa kuzha, <verse eid="MAT 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49" />akale kova etanga kuloba bashingikwaina, nokulya nokunwa nabakolwi, <verse eid="MAT 24:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50" />tezi wonshingi yoyu unoozha nezhuba lyaasinoyeesela nonshaji waasinoziba, <verse eid="MAT 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51" />unoompa chilango akale unoombiga nabachengeji, yoko banhu kubachabekwiila nokuziya meno.”<verse eid="MAT 24:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25" />
  <para style="s">Unkwejaniso WeMhandala Igumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1" />“Nooyo unshaji bushe bwedenga bunookwejaniswa nemhandala igumi jakenda namalambi ajo kunotandamija unkwasha. <verse eid="MAT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2" />Bashanu baluba malema akale bashanu bakabeli bachenjevu. <verse eid="MAT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3" />Yabaya baluba malema, bakanyamula malambi abo, koga abajakanyamula mafuta, <verse eid="MAT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4" />koga bachenjevu bakenda namafuta muhali pamwempela namalambi abo. <verse eid="MAT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5" />Unkwasha ajilwa kuswika, bose bakachugula, bakalala.”<verse eid="MAT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6" />“Koga pakati pobusiku kwakashomejwa kuwhi, ‘Mukani unkwasha waswika, bhudani pazhe muuntandamije!’ <verse eid="MAT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7" />Pakalepo jose imhandala jakanyamuka akale jakalonganya malambi ajo. <verse eid="MAT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8" />Akale malema akati kubachenjevu, ‘Tipenibo mamwe mafuta enu, nokuti malambi edu amujima.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9" />Koga bachenjevu bakashandula beti, ‘aatotikwana isu namwi, imwi indani kuna banotengesa munozwitengela.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10" />Pabakenda kunotenga, unkwasha wakaswika. Yabaya bakabakazwilonganyila bakangwina naye mumabhiko okulobolana, unkoba ukakonywa.”<verse eid="MAT 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11" />“Mushule mwozwo jimwe imhandala jakaswikabo, jiti, ‘tezi, tezi, tizhulileni.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12" />Koga iye wakashandula, eti, ‘chokomende, anditomuziba imwi.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13" />“Nokudalo galani mwakamilila, nokuti amutoziba izhuba kana unshaji.”<verse eid="MAT 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unkwejaniso Wabashingi Batatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Luka 19:11-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14" />“Akale bushe bwaMwali bunanga sonhu wakabeli nolwendo, wakashoba bashingi babe, akabasiyila ifuma iye ilimumaboko abo, <verse eid="MAT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15" />umwe wakompa tuputu tushanu twendalama, umwe tubili, umwebo kamwempela, umwe noumwe wabo wakapiwa sokutubula kukwe. Kova enda. <verse eid="MAT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16" />Iye wakapiwa tuputu tushanu wakatenga nokutengesa, akawana tumwe tuputu tushanu. <verse eid="MAT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17" />Akale yoyo wakapiwa tuputu tubili wakatenga nokutengesa bo, akawana ingwano yotumwe tubili pezhulu. <verse eid="MAT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18" />Koga iye wakatambula kaputu kamwempela wakenda akakachila pasi, esisa imali yatezi uwe.”<verse eid="MAT 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19" />“Ngweno kwapinda unshaji undefu tezi wabashingi yaba wakabuya, akababhuza kuti bakatani nemali yaakababasiyila. <verse eid="MAT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20" />Wakezha yoyo wakabapiwa tuputu tushanu, ebuza tumwe tushanu, eti, ‘Tezi, mwakandisiyila tuputu tushanu, lingani ndawana tumwe tushanu.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21" />Tezi uwe wakati kwaali, ‘Wata zwibuyanana, iwi unshingi umbuyanana ulobimbika, wabimbika pazwitukutuku, ndokubiga pezhulu pezwinji, ngwina, mulushanto lwatezi uwo.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22" />Akale iye bo wakapiwa tuputu tubili, wakezha eti, ‘Tezi, mwakandisiyila tuputu tubili, ndakawana imwe ingwano yotumwe tubili pezhulu.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23" />Tezi uwe wakati kwaali, ‘wata zwibuyanana, iwi unshingi umbuyanana ulobimbika, wakabimbika panazwitukutuku, ndokubiga pezhulu pezwinji, ngwina mulushanto lwatezi uwo.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24" />Iye bo wakapiwa kaputu kamwempela wakezha mbeli, akati, ‘Tezi, ndakabeziba kuti unhu unkukutu, unovuna pausijakabyala, akale unobunganisa pausakamezha, <verse eid="MAT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25" />Nezwo ndakatya, ndikakachila nokukasisa pasi, haka kaputu kako.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26" />Koga tezi uwe wakashandula, eti, ‘Iwi unshingi umbi kasakasa, akale usimbe, wakabeziba kuti ndinovuna pandisijakabyala, akale ndobunganisa pandisijakamezha? <verse eid="MAT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27" />Wakabokwelela kubiga imali yangu mubhenki, kutila kuti pandichaswika ndipiwe ili yazwala. <verse eid="MAT 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28" />Nokudalo tolani kaputu kwaali, mupe yoyo unatuputu tuligumi. <verse eid="MAT 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29" />Nokuti kuna iye wose unanazwo, unoopiwa zwilopamhijika, unooba nezwinji, koga yoyo usina, kana nezwaananazo zwinootolwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30" />Akale poselani unshingi yoyu usina lubhancho munhilima yokuzhe, yoko banhu kwabanoolila nokuziya meno.’<verse eid="MAT 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutongwa kwoKupejeleja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31" />“Paachezha Mwananhulumyana woNhu mukungaima kukwe, akale ingilozi jose jilinaye, pakalepo unoogala pechigalo chiche chobushe chinongaima. <verse eid="MAT 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32" />Mbeli kukwe kunookubunganywa induji jose, akale iye unoojipambulanya, sondyisi epambulanya imhwizi nembuji, <verse eid="MAT 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33" />akale unoobiga imhwizi kululyi lulwe, koga imbuji kuchesho. <verse eid="MAT 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34" />Ngweno She unooti kuna yabo baiko kululyi lulwe, ‘Izhani, imwi balokombolelwa baTate bangu, tolani ishabo lyobushe bumwakalonganyilwa kuvila kumatangisilo enyika, <verse eid="MAT 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35" />nokuti ndilinenzhala mwakandipa zwokulya, ndilinenyota mwakandipa zwokunwa, ndilimwezi mwakanditambula, <verse eid="MAT 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36" />ndakabeli chinkuna mwakandimbajika, ndilwala mwakandishanyila, ndilimuntolongo mwakezha kwandili.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37" />Pakalepo bakalulama banooshandula beti, ‘Tezi ndilini patakakubona ulinenzhala tikakupa cholya, kana ulinenyota tikakupa chonwa? <verse eid="MAT 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38" />Akale ndilini patakakubona uli mwezi tikakutambula, kana ulichinkuna tikakumbajika. <verse eid="MAT 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39" />Akale ndilini patakakubona ulwala kana uli muntolongo akale tikakushanyila?’ <verse eid="MAT 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40" />Akale She unoobashandula eti, ‘Chokomende ndoti kwamuli, yezwo zwamwakatila umwe wabanakwaina bangu upopasi, mwakazwitila imi.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41" />“Pakalepo unooti kuna yabo baiko kuchesho chiche, ‘Ibhudani kwandili, imwi mulofizhwa, mungwine mumoto usinopela wakalonganyilwa guluzhanje nengilozi jije, <verse eid="MAT 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42" />ndakabeli nenzhala, amujakandipa zwolya, ndakabeli nenyota akale amujakandipa zwonwa, <verse eid="MAT 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43" />ndakabeli mwezi akale amujakanditambula, ndilichinkuna amujakandimbajika, ndilwala akale ndili muntolongo, amujakandishanyila.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44" />Pakalepo naibo banooshandula beti, ‘Tezi, ndilini patakakubona uli nenzhala, uli nenyota, uli mwezi, ulichinkuna, ulwala, kana ulimuntolongo, tikasokubhancha?’ <verse eid="MAT 25:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45" />Pakalepo She unoobashandula eti, ‘Chokomende ndinoti kwamuli, sezwo musakatila umwe waaba bopasi, amujakanditila.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46" />Akale ibo banoonda kukulangwa kusinopela, koga balolulama banoongwina mubupenyu businopela.”<verse eid="MAT 25:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26" />
  <para style="s">Chilangano chokubulaya Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:1">Mako 14:1</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1">Luka 22:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Joni 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1" />Jesu paakapeja kulebeleka mawhi yaya, wakati kubalayijwa babe, <verse eid="MAT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2" />“Munoziba kuti kwasala mazhuba mabili kuti kuswike iPasika, nokudalo Mwananhulumyana woNhu unoopilwa ekahamilwe ponchinjikwa.”<verse eid="MAT 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3" />Ndipo batebuji bakulwana nabatungamili babanhu bakabungana pengumba yontebuji unkulwana, waluwhi Keyifasi, <verse eid="MAT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4" />bakalangana kuti bangonsunga chini Jesu nenzila yobuchengeji, bombulaye. <verse eid="MAT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5" />Koga bakati, “tisite alo nonshaji wemiliya, nokuti kungaba nokusogajikana mukati mwabanhu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Unogubwa kuBhetani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mako 14:3-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Joni 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6" />Jesu wakati eli kuBhetani mungumba yaSimoni wakabalwalabo mapelembuji, <verse eid="MAT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7" />eligele petebuli elikumulya, kwakaswika umwe unhukaji eli nefukwana lyamafuta obunde anodula kasa, akadila munsholo mwaJesu. <verse eid="MAT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8" />Balayijwa babe pabakazwibona yezwi bakanyemeswa nazwo, beti “Azanisilwani? <verse eid="MAT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9" />Mafuta obunde yaya ngana atengeswa nemali inji, ikapiwa basheti.”<verse eid="MAT 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10" />Jesu wakajiziba indangalilo jabo, akati kwabali, “Ini muunyaja unhukaji yoyu? Zwaanditila chinhu chibuyanana. <verse eid="MAT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11" />Nokuti basheti mobeli nabo unshaji wose, koga amutobeli nami unshaji wose. <verse eid="MAT 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12" />Kudila mafuta obunde pombili wangu, wazwita elonganyila kujikwa kwangu. <verse eid="MAT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13" />Chokomende ndinoti kwamuli, pose panoobhaunulwa indebo imbuya yeyi munyika yose, yezwi zwaata zwinoolebwa sechikumbulujo chiche.”<verse eid="MAT 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judasi Unocheta Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:10">Mako 14:10</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:11">11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luka 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14" />Pakalepo umwe wabegumi nababili, waluwhi Judasi Isikaliyoti, wakenda kubatebuji bakulwana, <verse eid="MAT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15" />akati, “Mungandipani ndingopila Jesu kwamuli?” Ibo bakondipa makumi matatu esiliva. <verse eid="MAT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16" />Kuvila yoyo unshaji wakashaka inzila yokuuncheta.<verse eid="MAT 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Unolya Chilayilo chePasika Chopejeleja Nabalayijwa Babe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mako 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-13">Luka 22:7-13</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Joni 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17" />Nezhuba lyotanga lyechinkwa chisina unkukumuso balayijwa bakezha kuna Jesu, beti, “Ngokupi kwaunoda kuti tinokulonganyila kuti ulye iPasika”<verse eid="MAT 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18" />Wakati kwabali, “Indani muguta kunoomwe unhu, munoti kwaali, ‘uNdayiji wati iye, unshaji wangu waaba pelyo, pengumba iyo ndipo pandichalyila iPasika nabalayijwa bangu.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19" />Balayijwa bakata sezwabakalayijwa naJesu bakalonganyila kulya kwePasika.<verse eid="MAT 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20" />Pakwakati aba madeko, wakagala petebuli, nabalayijwa bali gumi nababili, <verse eid="MAT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21" />pabakabelya, wakati, “chokomende ndinoti kwamuli, umwe wenu unoondicheta.”<verse eid="MAT 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22" />Ibo bakahetela kasa, bakatanga kuumbhuza umwe nomwe, beti, “Ndimi na, Tezi”<verse eid="MAT 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23" />Wakabashandula eti, “Iye wabiga luboko mundyilo nami, ndiye uchandicheta. <verse eid="MAT 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24" />Mwananhulumyana woNhu unoonda nenzila yakakwalwa, koga lutaka kunoyo uchacheta Mwananhulumyana woNhu! Zwaluba zwibuyanana kunhu yoyo, ngana asakazwalwa.”<verse eid="MAT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25" />Judasi, unoba iye wakoncheta, wakati “Ndimi na, Tezi”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:25">Jesu wakati kwaali, “Seni waleba.”<verse eid="MAT 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chilayilo chaShe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mako 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 BaKolinte 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26" />Bakati bechinolya Jesu wakatola chinkwa, akachikombolela, akachimedula, akachipa balayijwa babe, eti, “Tolani mulye, yoyu umbili wangu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27" />Wakatola unkombe akaboka, eti, “Inwani mose, <verse eid="MAT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28" />nokuti yeli ilopa lyangu lyechivumilano lichakutukila banji kutila kuti luchinyo lulekejelwe. <verse eid="MAT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29" />Ndinoti kwamuli, andichinoonwa kabili, chinwiwa chonchelo wonzhambi, kuswikila yelyo izhuba lyandichochinwa bupya namwi mubushe bwaTate bangu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30" />Pabakati bakwimba lwimbo bakabhuda benda kudunhu lyamaOlivi.<verse eid="MAT 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Unolebambeli nokuLambwa kukwe naPita</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mako 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Joni 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31" />Ngweno Jesu wakati kwabali, “Busiku yobuno imwi mose munonditizha, nokuti kulokwalwa kuti ‘Ndinooloba undyisi, imhwizi jedanga jinoomwayika.’ <verse eid="MAT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32" />Koga mushule mokumuka kwangu ndinoomutangila kunda kuGalili.”<verse eid="MAT 26:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33" />Pita wakashandula, eti, “Kojoba bamwe bose bakatizha nokuda kuko, imi anditokulamba.”<verse eid="MAT 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34" />Jesu wakati kwaali “Chokomende ndinoti kunawi, busiku yobuno unondilamba katatu, igukulume lisanu lyakokolika.”<verse eid="MAT 26:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35" />Pita wakati kwaali, “Kojoba kuli kufa nawi, anditokulamba.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:35">Bose balayijwa bakaleba alo.<verse eid="MAT 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu unonamata muGesemani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mako 14:32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luka 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36" />Jesu wakenda nabo kubugalo bunowhi Gesemani, akati kubalayijwa babe, “Galani yopa, ndikumunda yopaya kunonamata.” <verse eid="MAT 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37" />Wakatola Pita nabanabanhulumyana baZebhedi babili, akatanga kuhetela nokunyajikana kasa. <verse eid="MAT 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38" />Wakati kwabali, “Moyo wangu uloshulubala kasa, kuswikila pakufa, galani yopa, mulinde nami.”<verse eid="MAT 26:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39" />Wakakwenda inhambo inshomanana, wakafhigama, akakotama chiso chiche chikaguma pasi, akanamata, eti, “Tate bangu, kana zwitubukana, unkombe wokujiijwa yoyu ngaupinde kunami, kusibe sokuda kwangu, koga sokuda kwenu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40" />Wakabwilila kubalayijwa, akabawana belilele, akati kunaPita, “Amungalinde nami kwe awa limwempela chete? <verse eid="MAT 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41" />Lingani, munamate kuti musingwine mukukwejwa, umpepo unoda zwawo, koga umbili unabutela.”<verse eid="MAT 26:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42" />Akale lwabili wakasundubukila kwakale, akanonamata, eti, “Tate bangu, kana unkombe yoyu usinotubukana kubhiswa ndisanwa, ngazwitike sokuda kwenu.” <verse eid="MAT 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43" />Wakabwilila akale akabawana balala, nokuti ihope jakabakababhata.<verse eid="MAT 26:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44" />Wakabasiya, akenda kunonamata kechitatu, eleba mawhi akalewo. <verse eid="MAT 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45" />Wakezha kubalayijwa, akati kuna ibo, “Muchilele munyetutukwa zwenu? Bonani waswika unshaji, akale Mwananhulumyana woNhu ukumuchetwa mumaboko abachinyi. <verse eid="MAT 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46" />Nyamukani tikwende. Lingani, uncheti wangu wabapelyo.”<verse eid="MAT 26:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusungwa kwaJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mako 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Joni 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47" />Echinolebeleka, Judasi wakaswika, umwe wabegumi nababili, elinebunga igulwana bekabhata makwalabaza neswimbo, batumwa nabatebuji bakulwana nabatungamili babanhu. <verse eid="MAT 26:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48" />Feno uncheti wakapa chitondejo eti, “Yoyo undichamyonta, mumbhate, ndiye.”<verse eid="MAT 26:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49" />Wakenda kuna Jesu pakalepo, akati, “kwaswibha Ndayiji!” Akomyonta.<verse eid="MAT 26:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50" />Jesu wakati kunaiye, “nkwaina, ini uli yopano?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:50">Bakondila bakombhata akale bakonsunga. <verse eid="MAT 26:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51" />Hezwo, umwe waabo baluba naJesu wakabhisa igwalabaza lilye, akakwapula inzebe youmwe undanda wontebuji unkulwana. <verse eid="MAT 26:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52" />Jesu wakati kwaali, “Bwiliza igwalabaza lilyo pabugalo bwalyo, nokuti bose banobhata igwalabaza banopalajwa negwalabaza. <verse eid="MAT 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53" />Autoyeya na kuti ndinotubula kukumbila kuna Tate bangu kuti benditumile pakalepo makapo engilozi jabalwi anopinda pegumi lina mabili? <verse eid="MAT 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54" />Biya anoozhajikijwa chini makwalo, anoleba kuti zwibe alo.”<verse eid="MAT 26:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55" />Panooyo unshaji Jesu wakalebeleka kubunga lyabanhu, eti, “Mwezha namakwalabaza neswimbo kondibhata, soti ndimpanduki na? Izhuba nezhuba ndalugala muTempeli ndilayija, koga amujakandibhata. <verse eid="MAT 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56" />Koga zwose yezwi zwatikana kuti zwizhajikije zwakakwalwa nabapolofeti.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:56">Yopo balayijwa bose bakonsiya, bakatizha.<verse eid="MAT 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu unomiswa mbeli kweGota</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Mako 14:53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54">Luka 22:54</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:55">55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13">Joni 18:13</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:14">14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57" />Yabo bakabhata Jesu bakonsenga kunaKayifasi, untebuji unkulwana, kwakabakabungana balayiji bomulawo nabatungamili babanhu. <verse eid="MAT 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58" />Koga Pita wakontobela eli kule, mane kuswikila kulubazhe lwontebuji unkulwana, akangwina mukati akagala nabalindi eda kubona kuti zwinopela chini. <verse eid="MAT 26:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59" />Batebuji bakulwana namakulukota bakapyanga busumikiji bwokuniepela Jesu kuti bombulaye, <verse eid="MAT 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60" />asi apana bubakawana, kojoba basumikiji bokuniepa bakezha. Kumapejelejo kwakoowanika babili, <verse eid="MAT 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61" />bakati, “Yoyu unhu wakati, ‘Ndinotubula kukolomola itempeli lyaMwali, ndikalibakulula mumazhuba matatu.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 26:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62" />Untebuji unkulwana wakanyamuka, akati, “Iwi, aunenshandulo na? Ini yaba banhu besumikija zwibi pezhulu papo?” <verse eid="MAT 26:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63" />Koga Jesu wakanyalala. Untebuji unkulwana akati kwaali, “ita ikowhe naMwali umpenyu, utibuje kuti ndiwi Kristo Mwananhulumyana waMwali na”<verse eid="MAT 26:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64" />Jesu wakati kwaali, “Wazwileba woga. Koga ndinoti kwauli, kuvila ngweno munoobona Mwananhulumyana woNhu eligele kululyi lwoWamasimba, ezha eli pamakole edenga”<verse eid="MAT 26:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65" />Untebuji unkulwana wakajelula zwimbalo zwizwe, akati, “watuka Mwali. Biya tichinani nobusumikiji? Mwazwiwhila mwoga ngweno kutuka Mwali kwaata. <verse eid="MAT 26:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66" />Imwi moyeyani nazwo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:66">Bakashandula, beti, “Unokwelela lufu!”<verse eid="MAT 26:66" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67" />Bakatanga kuumfhila mate kumesho, bakondoba nefayindi. Bamwe bakomakula, <verse eid="MAT 26:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68" />beti, “Polofita kwatili, iwi Kristo! Ndiani wakuloba biya!”<verse eid="MAT 26:68" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pita Unolamba Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Mako 14:66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luka 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Joni 18:15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69" />Pita wakabeligele palubazhe. Unshingikaji wakezha kunaiye, akati kwaali, “Naibo wabeli naJesu wokuGalili.”<verse eid="MAT 26:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70" />Koga iye wakalamba pambeli pabo bose eti, “Anditozwiziba zwaukumuleba.” <verse eid="MAT 26:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71" />Paakakwenda akalingisa kushubo, umwe wabashingikaji wakombona, akabuja bakabeli pelyo kuti, “Unhu yoyu wabeli naJesu weNazaleta.”<verse eid="MAT 26:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72" />Iye wakalamba akale ekowha, eti, “Anditounziba unhu yoyu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:72" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73" />Mushule mwonshaji unshomanana yabo bakabelimile pelyo bakasendela, bakati kunaPita, “chokomende, ndiwi umwe wabo, tawha nondebelekelo uwo.”<verse eid="MAT 26:73" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74" />Ndipo paakatanga kutukana ekowha eti, “Unhu yoyu anditounziba.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:74">Pakalepo lyakakokoleka igukulume. <verse eid="MAT 26:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75" />Pita wakava ayeya mawhi akalebwa naJesu okuti, “Unoondilamba katatu, igukulume lisanu lyakokolika.” Iye wakabhuda pazhe akanolila zwineshungu.<verse eid="MAT 26:75" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27" />
  <para style="s">Jesu unopilwa kunaPilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:1">Mako 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1">Luka 23:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 23:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Joni 18:28-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1" />Palyakeja, bose batebuji bakulwana nabatungamili babanhu, bakagala igota lyokulebeleka nezwokubulaya Jesu, <verse eid="MAT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2" />pabakati bonsunga, bakenda naye kuna Pilato waluba untongi wedunhu.<verse eid="MAT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuzwisungilila KwaJudasi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 1:18">Mishingo 1:18</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 1:19">19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3" />Judasi uncheti uwe, paakabona kuti Jesu watongelwa lufu, wakazwifija, akabwiliza imali yesiliva makumi matatu kubatebuji bakulwana nabatungamili babanhu, <verse eid="MAT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4" />akati, “Ndachinya nokupila unhu usina luchinyo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:4">Koga ibo bakati, “Tineni nazwo isu? Zwibonele iwi woga.”<verse eid="MAT 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5" />Wakaposela imali yesiliva mutempeli, akabhuda akenda kunozwisungilila.<verse eid="MAT 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6" />Batebuji bakulwana bakanunga imali yesiliva bakati, “Azwimo mumulawo kuti ilondotwe muchikwama chemali yetempeli, nokuti imali yelopa.” <verse eid="MAT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7" />Bakagowana bakanotenga unda wombumbi wehali, kuti bube bugalo bwokujikila banhu basinozibikana. <verse eid="MAT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8" />Unda yoyo nanasi unowhi, “Unda weLopa.”<verse eid="MAT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9" />Yezwi zwakava zwazhajikija yezwiya zwakalebwa noMpolofeti Jelemiya, eti, “Bakatola makumi matatu emali yesiliva, yaluba indipilo yiye yakatalwa nabamwe banhu baIzilayeli, <verse eid="MAT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10" />bakabapa kuti ibe indipilo yominda wombumbi wehali, sokulayijwa kwangu naTezi.”<verse eid="MAT 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutongwa kwaJesu naPilato.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Mako 15:2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Luka 23:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Joni 18:33-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11" />Jesu wakama mbeli kontongi wedunhu, akabhuzwa nontongi wedunhu kuti, “Iwi ndiwi She wabaJuda na”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:11">Jesu wakashandula eti, “Seni ndiwi waleba.” <verse eid="MAT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12" />Batebuji bakulwana nabatungamili babanhu pabakompomela ndandu, apana chaakashandula.<verse eid="MAT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13" />Pilato wakati kwaali, “Auzwiwhile na kuti zwingana zwinhu zwibi zwibakumusumukija pezhulu papo”<verse eid="MAT 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14" />Koga aajakashandula, kana undandu umwempela wakapomelwa zwakachenamisa kasa untongi wedunhu.<verse eid="MAT 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Unotongelwa Kufa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mako 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Joni 18:39—19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15" />Ngweno nemiliya yePasika, untongi wedunhu walugala esungunula unsungwa umwempela waludiwa nabanhu. <verse eid="MAT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16" />Akale kwaluba nonsungwa waluzibikana kasa nezwito zwibi, waluwhi Jesu Bhalabhasi. <verse eid="MAT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17" />Pabakabungana Pilato wakati kwabali, “Ndiupi wamunoda kuti ndimusungunulile? Jesu Bhalabhasi kana Jesu unowhi Kristo?” <verse eid="MAT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18" />Nokuti waluziba kuti bakompila kwaali noluchibo.<verse eid="MAT 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19" />Pilato wakati echigele pechigalo chobutongi, unkaji uwe wakontumila unhu eti, “Usibe neni noyu unhu wakalulama, nokuti ndanyajikana kasa naye mumaloto angu nasi.”<verse eid="MAT 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20" />Feno batebuji bakulwana nabatungamili babanhu bakakutaija ibunga lyabanhu kuti likumbile Bhalabhasi, asi Jesu ebulayiwe. <verse eid="MAT 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21" />Untongi wedunhu wakababhuza akati, “Ngoupi wababili yaba wamunoda kuti ndimusungunulile?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:21">Bakashandula beti, “Bhalabhasi.”<verse eid="MAT 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22" />Pilato wakababhuza eti, “Nditeni naJesu unowhi Kristo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:22">Bakati ibo bose, “Ngekahamilwe panchinjikwa!”<verse eid="MAT 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23" />Iye wakati, “Nokuda kweni, ndichipi chibi chaata?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:23">Koga ibo bakanyanya kushomeja beti, “Ngekahamilwe panchinjikwa.”<verse eid="MAT 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24" />Pilato paakabona kuti azwichinobhancha, asi kwaba nezhoba, wakatola ivula akashamba maboko awe mbeli kwebunga lyabanhu, eti, “Imi andinani nelopa lyoyu unhu, zwiboneleni imwi.”<verse eid="MAT 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25" />Ibunga lyabanhu bose lyakashandula liti, “Ilopa lilye ngalibe pezhulu pedu nopezhulu pabana bedu!”<verse eid="MAT 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26" />Nokudalo wakabasungunulila Bhalabhasi, koga paakapeja kukwabhula Jesu, wakompila kuna ibo kuti ekahamilwe panchinjikwa.<verse eid="MAT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Balwi beHondo BanoHeula Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Mako 15:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2">Joni 19:2</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 19:3">3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27" />Balwi behondo bontongi wedunhu bakontola Jesu, bakongwinisa muchilola chontongi wedunhu, bakabunganisa ibunga lyabalwi behondo bose mbeli kukwe. <verse eid="MAT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28" />Bakombula chimbalo, bakombajika ishashiko inshaba. <verse eid="MAT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29" />Bakaluka chilemba chemhiwa, bakombajika munsholo uwe, bakombhatisa lushanga muluboko lulwe lwokululyi, bakafhugama mbeli kukwe boheula beti, “Ndauwe, she wabaJuda!” <verse eid="MAT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30" />Bakomfhila mate, bakatola lushanga bakobondoba nalwo munsholo. <verse eid="MAT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31" />Pabakapeja kuheula, bakombhisa ishashiko inshaba, bakombajika zwimbalo zwizwe, bakonsenga kuti benonkahamila panchinjikwa.<verse eid="MAT 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Unokahamilwa paNchinjikwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mako 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Joni 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32" />Pabakati babhuda pazhe, bakashangana nonhulume unezina linowhi Simoni wokuSayilini, bakomanikija kuti enyamule unchinjikwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33" />Pabakaswika kubugalo bunowhi Gologota, izina lileba kuti, “bugalo bwebhepe lyonsholo,” <verse eid="MAT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34" />bakompa iwaini liloshanganiswa nendulwe kuti enwe, koga wakati alabila, wakalamba kuinwa.<verse eid="MAT 27:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35" />Bakonkahamila, kova bekobana zwimbalo zwizwe, bakata ifumbefumbe. <verse eid="MAT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36" />Yopa bakagala pasi bakondinda. <verse eid="MAT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37" />Bakabiga pezhulu ponsholo uwe lukwalo lwondandu uwe lwokuti, “Yoyu ndiJesu, She wabaJuda.” <verse eid="MAT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38" />Kwakakahamilwa bapambi babili, umwe kululyi umwe kuchesho.<verse eid="MAT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39" />Bose bakabepinda pelyo bakontuka bejunguja misholo yabo, <verse eid="MAT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40" />beti, “Iwi unopalaja itempeli kova ulibaka mumazhuba matatu, zwichije! Kana uli Mwananhulumyana waMwali, ibhuluka panchinjikwa.”<verse eid="MAT 27:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41" />Batebuji bakulwana, balayiji bomulawo nabatungamili babanhu bakoheula naibo beti, <verse eid="MAT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42" />“Wakachija bamwe, asi aatotubula kuzwichija nokukwe. NdiShe wokwaIzilayeli, ngeebhuluke ngweno panchinjikwa kuti tidimbwe mwaali. <verse eid="MAT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43" />Unobimba naMwali, ngomunule ngweno kana ounda, nokuti iye wakabeti, ‘ndiMwananhulumyana waMwali.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 27:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44" />Nabapambi yabaya baakakahamilwa pamwempela nabo, bakontuka bo munzila imwempela.<verse eid="MAT 27:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kufa kwaJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mako 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Joni 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45" />Ngweno kwakaba nenhilima pasi pose kuvila masikati makulwana kunoswikila iawa lyatatu madeko. <verse eid="MAT 27:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46" />Nonshaji ungaba iawa lyatatu madeko, Jesu wakashomeja newhi igulwana eti, “Eli, Eli, lamasabakitani?” Ndiko kuti “Mwali wangu, Mwali wangu mwandisiyilani na?”<verse eid="MAT 27:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47" />Bamwe baabo bakabelimile pelyo pabakawha yezwi, bakati, “Yoyu unhu ukumushoba Elija.” <verse eid="MAT 27:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48" />Umwe wabo wakalabuka akanotola inganganga, akalimyuja muwaini linopanyuka, kova ebhayilila palushanga, ompa kuti enwe.<verse eid="MAT 27:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49" />Asi bamwe bakati, “Undekejeni tibone kuti Elija unozha konchija.”<verse eid="MAT 27:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50" />Jesu wakashomeja akale newhi igulwana, kova efa.<verse eid="MAT 27:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51" />Uncheka womuTempeli, wakajeluka ukaba zwibabi zwibili kuva pezhulu kunoswika pasi. Inyika yose ikateketa namabwe akakwamuka, <verse eid="MAT 27:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52" />makumbu akazhulika, nemitumbu minji yabachena bakafa ikamuswa, <verse eid="MAT 27:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53" />bakabhuda mumakumbu abo mushule mokumuka kukwe bakangwina muguta ijena, bakabonwa nabanhu banji.<verse eid="MAT 27:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54" />Feno untungamili balwi behondo nabaya baakabakalinda nabo, Jesu, pabakabona kuteketa kwenyika nezwimwe zwakatikana, bakava moyo kasa bakati, “Chokomende yoyu wabeli Mwananhulumyana waMwali!”<verse eid="MAT 27:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55" />Kwakabeli nabanhukaji banji bakabekalinga beli kule, ibo bakontobela Jesu kuva kuGalili, beumbhancha nokunshingila. <verse eid="MAT 27:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56" />Pakati pabo pakabeli naMariya unova kuguta lyeMagadala, naMariya amai baJemusi naJosefa, naamai babana banhulumyana baZebhedi.<verse eid="MAT 27:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kujikwa kwaJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mako 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Joni 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57" />Pakwakaba madeko, kwakezha unhulume umfumi wokuAlimatiya, waluwhi Josefa eli undayijwa waJesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58" />Wakenda kunaPilato kunokumbila kuti epiwe untumbu waJesu. Pilato wakalayila kuti epiwe. <verse eid="MAT 27:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59" />Josefa wakatola untumbu, akomputilija noncheka welineni wakashambijika. <verse eid="MAT 27:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60" />Wakanoumbiga mugumbu lilye lyebhako ibhya, lyaakaba azwilonganyila iye emene pebwe, akakungulija ihando yebwe pankoba wegumbu, kova enda. <verse eid="MAT 27:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61" />Mariya wokuMagadala nomwe Mariya, bakabelipo beligele bekalingisana negumbu.<verse eid="MAT 27:61" /></para>
  <para style="s">Balindi peGumbu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62" />Feno nezhuba linotobela, lyesabata, batebuji bakulwana nabaFalisi bakenda kunaPilato, <verse eid="MAT 27:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63" />bakati kwaali, “Tezi tayeya kuti unchengeji yondiya paakaba eli umpenyu wakati, ‘Mushule mwamazhuba matatu ndinoomuka.’ <verse eid="MAT 27:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64" />Nokudalo ilayilani kuti igumbu lilye lilindwe kuswikila izhuba lyatatu, pamwe balayijwa babe bangezha koonkwiba beti kubanhu, ‘Wamuka mubafi,’ nezwo kuchengeja kwokupejisila kunova kwanyanya kupinda kwokutanga.”<verse eid="MAT 27:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65" />Pilato wakati kwabali, “Munabalindi behondo, indani munolinda sokubona kwenu.”<verse eid="MAT 27:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66" />Nokudalo bakenda bakamatila ibwe bebiga imhande, nokusiya balindi babo.<verse eid="MAT 27:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28" />
  <para style="s">Kumuka kwaJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Mako 16:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Joni 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1" />Mushule mweSabata, kumijelo nezhuba lyokutanga lyeviki, Mariya wokuMagadala noumwe Mariya bakenda kunobona igumbu. <verse eid="MAT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2" />Bonani, kwakaba nokuteketa kwenyika kukulugulu, nokuti ingilozi yaTezi yaluba yabheluka iva kudenga, ikakungulija ihando yebwe yelyo pankoba, ikagala pakale. <verse eid="MAT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3" />Yakaboneka solupalanganda, chimbalo chayo chili chichena twaa <verse eid="MAT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4" />Balindi bakateketa betya iye, bakaba sabalofa.<verse eid="MAT 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5" />Koga ingilozi yakati kubanhukaji, “Musitye, nokuti ndinoziba mukumupyanga Jesu wakaba akakaamilwa. <verse eid="MAT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6" />Aachipo yopano, nokuti wamuka mubafi, sokuleba kukwe. Izhani mubone pabugalo paakabakalajikwa. <verse eid="MAT 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7" />Nokudalo, indani nokukambija munobuja balayijwa babe kuti wamuka mubafi, akale unomutangila kunda kuGalili, yoko kwamuchanoombona. Whililani, ndamubuja.”<verse eid="MAT 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8" />Bakabhuda kugumbu nokukambija beli nolutyo akale nokushanta kukulwana, bakalabuka kunobuja balayijwa babe.<verse eid="MAT 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9" />Bonani, Jesu wakabashangana nabo akati, “Mwamuka.” Nokudalo bakaswika bakafhugama, bakombhata kumakumbo bakonamata. <verse eid="MAT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10" />Jesu wakati kwabali, “Musitye, indani munobuja banakwaina bangu kuti bende kuGalili, yoko ndikwo kwabachanondibona.”<verse eid="MAT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chiwijo chabalindi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11" />Bakati bechinokwenda, bamwe babalindi bakenda kuguta kunobuja batebuji bakulwana, pezhulu pezwose zwakatikana. <verse eid="MAT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12" />Pabakabungana batebuji bakulwana nabatungamili babanhu, bakagowana bakapa imali inji kubalwi, <verse eid="MAT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13" />beti kwabali, “Bujani banhu kuti, ‘balayijwa babe ndibo bakezha busiku bakounkwiba isu tililele.’ <verse eid="MAT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14" />Kana yezwi zwikazibwa nontongi wedunhu igulwana, ndisu tichonguncha, kuti imwi musipiwe undandu.”<verse eid="MAT 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15" />Bakatola imali bakata sokulayilwa kwabo, lungano yolu lwakwenda pakati pabaJuda kuswika nasi.<verse eid="MAT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Unobonekwa nabaLayijwa babe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mako 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Joni 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Mishingo 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16" />Ngweno balayijwa babe bali gumi nomwempela bakenda kuGalili, kudunhu libakabalayilwa naJesu. <verse eid="MAT 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17" />Bakati bombona bakonamata, asi bamwe bakahajika. <verse eid="MAT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18" />Jesu wakenda kwabali akati, “Masimba ose okudenga nopenyika akapiwa imi. <verse eid="MAT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19" />Nokudalo indani mute kuti inyika yose ibe nabalayijwa bangu, mubabhabhatize muzina lyaTate nelyoMwananhulumyana nelyoMpepo uNchena. <verse eid="MAT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20" />Mubalayije kuti belondote zwose zwindakamulayila, akale ndinoba ndili namwi unshaji uli wose kuswikila kupela kwonshaji.”<verse eid="MAT 28:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28" />
</usx>